<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Job</para>
  <para style="toc1">JOB</para>
  <para style="toc2">Job</para>
  <para style="toc3">Job</para>
  <para style="mt1">JOB</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOB 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 1:1" />Te gen yon mesye nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:20">Jr 25:20</ref></char></note>peyi Uts ki te rele Job. Nonm sa a te san repwòch, dwat, te gen lakrent Bondye e te vire kite tout mal. <verse eid="JOB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 1:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 42:13">Job 42:13</ref></char></note>Sèt fis ak twa fi te fèt a li menm. <verse eid="JOB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 1:3" />Byen li te monte a sèt-mil mouton, twa-mil chamo, senk-san bèf kabwèt, senk-san femèl bourik ak anpil sèvitè. Nonm sila a se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 29:25">Job 29:25</ref></char></note>pi gran òm nan tout pati lès la. <verse eid="JOB 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 1:4" />Fis li yo te konn ale fè yon fèt lakay a yo chak, selon jou fèt pa li a, e yo te konn envite twa sè yo pou manje e bwè avèk yo. <verse eid="JOB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 1:5" />Lè jou a fèt yo te fini, Job ta voye konsakre yo, nan leve granmmaten pou ofri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 8:20">Jen 8:20</ref></char></note>ofrann brile selon fòs kantite a yo tout. Paske Job te di: “Petèt fis mwen yo te peche, e te modi Bondye nan kè yo.” Konsa Job te fè tout tan.<verse eid="JOB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 1:6" />Alò, te rive yon jou lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 38:7">Job 38:7</ref></char></note> fis a Bondye yo te vin prezante yo menm devan Bondye, e Satan osi, te rive pami yo. <verse eid="JOB 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 1:7" />SENYÈ a te di a Satan: “Depi kibò ou sòti?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 1:7">Konsa, Satan te reponn SENYÈ a epi te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 5:8">I Pi 5:8</ref></char></note>“Soti pwomennen sou latè a, e mache toupatou sou li.”<verse eid="JOB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 1:8" />SENYÈ a te di a Satan: “Èske ou remake <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:2-7">Jos 1:2-7</ref></char></note>sèvitè mwen an, Job? Paske nanpwen okenn tankou li sou latè, yon nonm san repwòch ki gen lakrent Bondye, e ki vire kite mal.”<verse eid="JOB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 1:9" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 12:9">Rev 12:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Satan te reponn SENYÈ a: “Èske Job gen lakrent Bondye pou granmesi? <verse eid="JOB 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 1:10" />Èske Ou pa t fè yon kloti antoure li avèk lakay li avèk tout sa li genyen sou chak kote? Ou te beni zèv men li yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:3">Job 1:3</ref></char></note>byen li grandi anpil nan peyi a. <verse eid="JOB 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 1:11" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 2:5">Job 2:5</ref></char></note>Men lonje men Ou depi koulye a, touche tout sa li posede. Anverite li va modi Ou menm devan figi Ou.”<verse eid="JOB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 1:12" />SENYÈ a te di a Satan: “Gade byen, tout sa li genyen sou pouvwa ou. Sèlman pa lonje men ou sou kò li.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 1:12">Konsa, Satan te pati devan prezans SENYÈ a. <verse eid="JOB 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 1:13" />Alò, nan jou ke fis li avèk fi li yo t ap manje ak bwè diven lakay pi gran frè a, <verse eid="JOB 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 1:14" />yon mesaje te rive kote Job. Li te di: “Bèf yo t ap raboure, e bourik yo t ap manje akote yo, <verse eid="JOB 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 1:15" />men konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 10:7">Jen 10:7</ref></char></note>Sabeyen yo te atake vin pran yo. Anplis, yo te touye sèvitè yo ak lam nepe, e se sèl mwen ki te chape pou di ou sa.”<verse eid="JOB 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 1:16" />Pandan li te toujou ap pale, yon lòt osi te rive pou l te di: “Dife Bondye te tonbe soti nan syèl la, e te brile tout mouton avèk sèvitè yo. Li te manje yo nèt e se mwen sèl ki te chape pou di ou sa.”<verse eid="JOB 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 1:17" />Pandan li te toujou ap pale, yon lòt osi te rive epi te di: “Kaldeyen yo te fòme twa bann pou vin desann sou chamo yo. Yo te pran yo, e touye sèvitè yo avèk lanm nepe. Se mwen sèl ki chape pou di ou sa.”<verse eid="JOB 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 1:18" />Pandan li te toujou ap pale, yon lòt osi te rive epi te di: “Fis ou yo avèk fi ou yo t ap manje ak bwè diven lakay pi gran frè a, <verse eid="JOB 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 1:19" />epi men vwala, yo gwo van te travèse dezè a pou frape kat kwen kay la. Li te tonbe sou jenn moun sa yo epi yo te mouri. Se mwen sèl ki te chape pou vin di ou sa.”<verse eid="JOB 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 1:20" />Konsa Job te leve. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:29-34">Jen 37:29-34</ref></char></note>chire vètman li, te pase razwa nan tèt li e te tonbe atè pou l te adore. <verse eid="JOB 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 1:21" />Li te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 5:15">Ekl 5:15</ref></char></note>Toutouni mwen te sòti nan vant manman m e toutouni mwen va retounen la. SENYÈ a te bay, e SENYÈ a pran. Beni se non SENYÈ a.” <verse eid="JOB 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 1:22" />Pandan tout sa, Job pa t fè peche, ni li pa t bay repwòch a Bondye.<verse eid="JOB 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOB 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 2:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 1:6-8">Job 1:6-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ankò, yon jou te rive lè fis a Bondye yo te vin prezante yo devan SENYÈ a, e Satan osi te vin prezante li menm devan SENYÈ a. <verse eid="JOB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 2:2" />SENYÈ a te di a Satan: “Kibò ou sòti?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 2:2">Satan te reponn SENYÈ a epi te di: “Soti pwomennen sou latè, e te mache toupatou sou li.”<verse eid="JOB 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 2:3" />SENYÈ a te di a Satan: “Èske ou te remake sèvitè Mwen an, Job? Paske nanpwen okenn moun tankou li sou latè, yon nonm san repwòch e dwat ki gen lakrent Bondye, e ki vire kite tout mal. Epi li toujou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 27:5-6">Job 27:5-6</ref></char></note>kenbe rèd ak entegrite li, malgre ou te eksite Mwen kont li san koz.”<verse eid="JOB 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 2:4" />Satan te reponn SENYÈ a. Li te di: “Chè pou chè! Wi, tout sa yon nonm genyen, li va bay pou lavi li. <verse eid="JOB 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 2:5" />Malgre sa, lonje men Ou koulye a e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 19:20">Job 19:20</ref></char></note>touche zo li avèk chè li. Li va modi Ou devan figi Ou.”<verse eid="JOB 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 2:6" />Konsa, SENYÈ a te di a Satan: “Gade byen, li nan pouvwa ou. Sèlman konsève lavi li.”<verse eid="JOB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 2:7" />Konsa, Satan te sòti nan prezans SENYÈ a e te frape Job avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:35">Det 28:35</ref></char></note>abse ak maleng soti anba pye li jis rive sou kwòn tèt li. <verse eid="JOB 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 2:8" />Job te pran yon mòso cha kanari pou grate kò l pandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:30">Éz 27:30</ref></char></note>li te chita nan mitan sann yo. <verse eid="JOB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 2:9" />Epi madanm li te di l: “Èske ou toujou kenbe rèd a entegrite ou a? Modi Bondye e mouri!”<verse eid="JOB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 2:10" />Men li te di li: “Ou pale kon youn nan fanm san konprann. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:21">Job 1:21</ref></char></note>Èske anverite nou va aksepte sa ki bon nan men Bondye, e pa aksepte sa ki mal?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 2:10">Nan tout sa, Job pa t peche avèk bouch li. <verse eid="JOB 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 2:11" />Alò, lè twa zanmi a Job yo te tande tout malè ki te rive li yo, yo te vini yo chak sòti nan pwòp plas yo, Éliphaz, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 6:19">Job 6:19</ref></char></note>Temanit lan, Bildad, Souachyen an ak Tsophar, Naamatit la. Yo te òganize yon randevou ansanm pou vini fè konsolasyon avèk li, e bay li rekonfò. <verse eid="JOB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 2:12" />Lè yo te leve zye yo a distans, yo pa t rekonèt li; yo te leve vwa yo anlè e te kriye. Yo chak te chire rad yo, e yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 2:10">Lam 2:10</ref></char></note>jete pousyè sou tèt yo vè syèl la. <verse eid="JOB 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 2:13" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 50:10">Jen 50:10</ref></char></note>Konsa, yo te chita atè avèk li pandan sèt jou ak sèt nwit san pèsòn pa t pale yon mo ak li, paske yo te wè ke doulè li te tèlman gran.<verse eid="JOB 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOB 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 3:1" />Lè l fini, Job te ouvri bouch li e te modi jou li te fèt la. <verse eid="JOB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 3:2" />Job te di:<verse eid="JOB 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 3:3" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 20:14-18">Jr 20:14-18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Kite jou ke m te dwe fèt la peri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:3">ak nwit ki te anonse ‘se yon gason ki fèt la.’<verse eid="JOB 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 3:4" />Ke jou sa a kapab vin fènwa nèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:4">Pa kite Bondye anwo a pran swen li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:4">ni limyè vin klere sou li.<verse eid="JOB 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 3:5" />Kite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 13:16">Jr 13:16</ref></char></note>fènwa avèk gwo tenèb reklame li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:5">Kite fènwa jou sa a modi li.<verse eid="JOB 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 3:6" />Selon nwit sa a, kite tenèb sezi li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:6">Kite li pa gen rejwisans nan jou ane a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:6">Kite li pa antre nan chif ki konte mwa yo.<verse eid="JOB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 3:7" />Koute byen, kite nwit sa a rete esteril.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:7">Pa kite okenn kri lajwa antre ladann.<verse eid="JOB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 3:8" />Kite sila ki konn modi jou yo modi jou sa a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:8">sila ki prè pou fè Levyatan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 41:1-25">Job 41:1-25</ref></char></note>leve kò l.<verse eid="JOB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 3:9" />Kite zetwal lannwit li yo vin etenn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:9">Kite li espere limyè, men pa twouve l.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:9">E kite li pa wè maten vin parèt,<verse eid="JOB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 3:10" />akoz li pa t fèmen ouvèti vant manman m,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:10">ni kache twoub devan zye m.<verse eid="JOB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 3:11" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 10:18-19">Job 10:18-19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Poukisa mwen pa t mouri lè m te fèt?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:11">Sòti nan vant li e mouri la menm?<verse eid="JOB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 3:12" />Poukisa jenou yo te resevwa m, e poukisa tete a, pou m ta pran?<verse eid="JOB 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 3:13" />Paske koulye a mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:13-19">Job 3:13-19</ref></char></note>t ap gen tan kouche pou m jwenn lapè;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:13">mwen t ap dòmi depi lè sa a e mwen t ap twouve repo,<verse eid="JOB 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 3:14" />ansanm ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:18">Job 12:18</ref></char></note>wa ak konseye latè</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:14">ki te rebati ansyen mazi yo pou kont yo;<verse eid="JOB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 3:15" />oswa avèk prens <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 27:16-17">Job 27:16-17</ref></char></note>ki te gen lò yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:15">ki t ap plen lakay yo ak ajan;<verse eid="JOB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 3:16" />Oswa kon yon fòs kouch ki kache, mwen pa t ap egziste,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:16">kon yon pitit ki pa t janm wè limyè.<verse eid="JOB 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 3:17" />La, mechan yo sispann fè laraj,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:17">e la moun fatige yo jwenn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 17:6">Job 17:6</ref></char></note>repo.<verse eid="JOB 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 3:18" />Prizonye yo alèz ansanm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:18">Yo p ap tande vwa a sipèvizè a.<verse eid="JOB 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 3:19" />Ni piti, ni gran yo la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:19">E esklav la lib de mèt li.<verse eid="JOB 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 3:20" />“Poukisa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 20:18">Jr 20:18</ref></char></note>limyè bay a sila ki soufri a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:20">e lavi a nanm anmè a,<verse eid="JOB 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 3:21" />ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 9:6">Rev 9:6</ref></char></note>anvi wè lanmò, men nanpwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:21">e fouye plis pou twouve li pase trezò kache,<verse eid="JOB 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 3:22" />ki rejwi anpil e fè lwanj lè yo rive nan tonbo a?<verse eid="JOB 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 3:23" />Poukisa limyè bay a yon nonm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 19:6-12">Job 19:6-12</ref></char></note>ak chemen an kache a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:23">ke Bondye te jennen tout kote a?<verse eid="JOB 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 3:24" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 6:7">Job 6:7</ref></char></note>soupi mwen yo parèt menm moman</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:24">manje a rive devan ze m.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:24">Epi kri mwen yo vide tankou dlo.<verse eid="JOB 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 3:25" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:28">Job 9:28</ref></char></note>sa m krent lan te vini sou mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:25">Sa ke m pa vle wè a te tonbe sou mwen.<verse eid="JOB 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 3:26" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 7:13-14">Job 7:13-14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mwen pa alèz, ni mwen pa anpè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:26">Mwen pa jwenn repo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:26">ni m pa kal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:26">men se boulvèsman ki vin parèt.”<verse eid="JOB 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOB 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 4:1" />Konsa, Éliphaz, Temanit lan te reponn;<verse eid="JOB 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 4:2" />Si yon moun ta eseye pale yon mo avèk ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:2">èske ou va pèdi pasyans?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:2">Men se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 32:18-20">Job 32:18-20</ref></char></note>kilès ki kab refize pale?<verse eid="JOB 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 4:3" />Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:3-4">Job 4:3-4</ref></char></note>ou te enstwi anpil lòt moun;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:3">ou te ranfòse menm fèb yo.<verse eid="JOB 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 4:4" />Pawòl ou yo te ede fèb yo kanpe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:4">e ou te ranfòse jenou ki manke fòs yo.<verse eid="JOB 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 4:5" />Men koulye a, se sou ou sa rive,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:5">e ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 6:4">Job 6:4</ref></char></note>pa gen pasyans.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:5">Sa touche ou menm e ou vin dekouraje nèt.<verse eid="JOB 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 4:6" />Èske se pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:1">Job 1:1</ref></char></note>lakrent Bondye pa ou ki konfyans ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:6">ak entegrite chemen ou yo ki espwa ou?<verse eid="JOB 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 4:7" />“Sonje byen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 36:6-7">Job 36:6-7</ref></char></note>se kilès ki kon peri inosan?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:7">Oswa ki kote ou wè moun ladwati yo te detwi?<verse eid="JOB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 4:8" />Selon sa ke mwen menm te wè, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:13">Os 10:13</ref> </char></note>sila ki raboure inikite yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:8">ak sila ki simen twoub yo, yo rekòlte li.<verse eid="JOB 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 4:9" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:4">És 11:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pa souf Bondye, yo peri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:9">e pa van chalè Li, yo fini nèt.<verse eid="JOB 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 4:10" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 5:15">Job 5:15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gwo vwa a lyon fewòs la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:10">vwa fewòs a lyon an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:10">e dan a jenn lyon yo fin kase.<verse eid="JOB 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 4:11" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 29:17">Job 29:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pi gran lyon an peri paske li manke manje,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:11">e pitit li yo vin gaye.<verse eid="JOB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 4:12" />“Alò, an kachèt yon pawòl rive sou mwen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:12">zòrèy mwen te resevwa yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 26:14">Job 26:14</ref></char></note>ti souf li.<verse eid="JOB 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 4:13" />Pami <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 33:15">Job 33:15</ref></char></note>refleksyon enkyetan ki sòti nan vizyon lannwit yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:13">lè dòmi pwofon tonbe sou moun,<verse eid="JOB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 4:14" />laperèz te vini sou mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:14">Mwen te tranble e zo m yo te souke.<verse eid="JOB 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 4:15" />Konsa, yon lespri te pase kote figi mwen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:15">plim sou chè mwen, te kanpe sou kò m.<verse eid="JOB 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 4:16" />Li te kanpe an plas, men mwen pa t kab distenge aparans li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:16">Yon fòm te devan zye m.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:16">Te gen silans, epi mwen te tande yon vwa:<verse eid="JOB 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 4:17" />'Èske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:2">Job 9:2</ref></char></note>lòm kapab jis devan Bondye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:17">Èske yon nonm kapab san tach devan Sila ki fè l la?<verse eid="JOB 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 4:18" />Menm nan sèvitè Li yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 15:15">Job 15:15</ref></char></note>Li pa mete konfyans;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:18">ak pwòp zanj Li yo, Li jwenn fot.<verse eid="JOB 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 4:19" />Konbyen anplis, pou sila ki rete nan kay fèt an ajil yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:19">ki gen pousyè kon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Jen 2:7</ref></char></note>fondasyon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:19">ki vin kraze devan papiyon!<verse eid="JOB 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 4:20" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 14:2">Job 14:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Antre maten ak aswè, yo vin kase an mòso;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:20">san yo pa wè anyen, yo peri nèt.<verse eid="JOB 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 4:21" />Èske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 8:22">Job 8:22</ref></char></note>kòd soutyen tant yo pa plwaye pa anndan?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:21">Yo mouri konsa, san sajès.'<verse eid="JOB 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOB 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 5:1" />“Rele koulye a; èske gen moun ki pou reponn?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:1">A kilès nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 15:15">Job 15:15</ref></char></note>sen fidèl yo ke ou va vire?<verse eid="JOB 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 5:2" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 12:16">Pwov 12:16</ref></char></note>rankin va touye moun ki plen foli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:2">e jalouzi va touye moun senp lan.<verse eid="JOB 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 5:3" />Mwen te wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 12:2">Jr 12:2</ref> </char></note>moun san konprann ki t ap pran rasin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:3">e byen vit, mwen te denonse kay li.<verse eid="JOB 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 5:4" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 4:11">Job 4:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fis li yo pa jwenn sekirite ditou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:4">menm nan pòtay la, yo oprime,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:4">ni pa gen moun pou delivre yo.<verse eid="JOB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 5:5" />Moun grangou yo devore rekòlt li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:5">e mennen l yon kote plen pikan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:5">Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 18:8-10">Job 18:8-10</ref></char></note>pelen an rete ovèt pou sezi tout byen yo.<verse eid="JOB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 5:6" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 15:35">Job 15:35</ref></char></note>malè pa sòti nan pousyè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:6">ni gwo twoub pa pouse soti nan tè;<verse eid="JOB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 5:7" />paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 14:1">Job 14:1</ref></char></note>lòm fèt pou gwo twoub,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:7">tankou etensèl dife vole anlè.<verse eid="JOB 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 5:8" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 13:2-3">Job 13:2-3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Men pou mwen, mwen ta chache Bondye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:8">pou m ta plede kòz mwen devan Bondye.<verse eid="JOB 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 5:9" />Bondye Ki konn fè gwo bagay ki depase konesans lan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:9">mèvèy ki pa kab menm konte yo.<verse eid="JOB 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 5:10" />Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 36:27-29">Job 36:27-29</ref></char></note>bay lapli sou tè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:10">e voye dlo sou chan yo,<verse eid="JOB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 5:11" />Jiskaske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:29">Job 22:29</ref></char></note>Li leve sila ki enb yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:11">e sila ki an dèy yo, li leve bay sekou.<verse eid="JOB 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 5:12" />Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 33:10">Sòm 33:10</ref></char></note>anile manèv a sila ki gen riz yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:12">pou men yo pa reyisi.<verse eid="JOB 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 5:13" />Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 37:24">Job 37:24</ref></char></note>kaptire saj yo nan pwòp riz pa yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:13">e konsèy a moun k ap twonpe moun nan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:13">vin kontrekare byen vit.<verse eid="JOB 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 5:14" />Nan gwo lajounen, yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:25">Job 12:25</ref> </char></note>jwenn ak tenèb,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:14">e yo egare gwo midi tankou se te lannwit.<verse eid="JOB 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 5:15" />Men li sove yo de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:11">Job 4:11</ref></char></note>nepe a pwop bouch yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:15">e menm malere a chape nan men pwisan an.<verse eid="JOB 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 5:16" />Akoz sa, sila ki san sekou a gen espwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:16">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 107:42">Sòm 107:42</ref></char></note>inikite oblije pe bouch li.<verse eid="JOB 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 5:17" />“Gade byen kijan nonm</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:17">ke Bondye bay chatiman an gen kè kontan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:17">Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:5-11">Eb 12:5-11</ref></char></note>pa meprize disiplin Toupwisan an.<verse eid="JOB 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 5:18" />Paske se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 30:28">És 30:28</ref></char></note>Li menm ki blese,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:18">e se Li menm ki retire blesè a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:18">Li fè donmaj la, e pwòp men L ki geri l.<verse eid="JOB 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 5:19" />Soti sis fwa, Li va delivre ou de twoub ou yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:19">Menm nan sèt fwa, mal la p ap kab touche ou.<verse eid="JOB 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 5:20" />Nan gwo grangou Li va delivre ou devan lanmò,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:20">e nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 144:10">Sòm 144:10</ref> </char></note>lagè, devan pouvwa nepe a.<verse eid="JOB 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 5:21" />Ou va pwoteje devan blese a lang lan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:21">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:5-6">Sòm 91:5-6</ref></char></note> ou p ap pè vyolans lan lè l vin parèt.<verse eid="JOB 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 5:22" />Ou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 8:21">Job 8:21</ref></char></note>ri devan vyolans ak grangou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:22">e ou p ap pè bèt sovaj yo.<verse eid="JOB 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 5:23" />Paske ou va fè alyans ak wòch chan yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:23">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:6-9">És 11:6-9</ref></char></note>bèt sovaj yo va anpè avèk ou.<verse eid="JOB 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 5:24" />Ou va konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 8:6">Job 8:6</ref></char></note>tant ou an pwoteje,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:24">paske ou va vizite lakay ou san krent ni pèt.<verse eid="JOB 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 5:25" />Anplis, ou va konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 112:2">Sòm 112:2</ref></char></note>desandan ou yo va anpil,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:25">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:3-4">És 44:3-4</ref></char></note>sila ki sòti nan ou yo anpil tankou zèb latè.<verse eid="JOB 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 5:26" />Ou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 42:17">Job 42:17</ref></char></note>rive nan tonbo a ak tout fòs ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:26">tankou gwo sak ble nan sezon li.<verse eid="JOB 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 5:27" />Gade sa byen; nou te fè ankèt li, e se konsa li ye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:27">Tande sa e konnen l pou kont ou.”<verse eid="JOB 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOB 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 6:1" />Epi Job te reponn:<verse eid="JOB 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 6:2" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 31:6">Job 31:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“O ke doulè m ta kab peze pou mete nan balans lan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:2">ansanm ak gwo dega ki vin sou mwen yo!<verse eid="JOB 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 6:3" />Paske li ta pi lou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 23:2">Job 23:2</ref></char></note>pase sab lanmè yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:3">Akoz sa a, pawòl mwen yo te tèlman san règ.<verse eid="JOB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 6:4" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 16:13">Job 16:13</ref></char></note>flèch Toupwisan an fin antre anndan m;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:4">lespri m ap bwè pwazon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:4">Gwo laperèz Bondye a vin alinye kont mwen.<verse eid="JOB 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 6:5" />Èske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 39:5-8">Job 39:5-8</ref></char></note>bourik mawon ranni sou zèb li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:5">oswa bèf rele sou manje li?<verse eid="JOB 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 6:6" />Èske bagay san gou kapab manje san sèl,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:6">oswa èske pati blan nan zye poul a gen gou?<verse eid="JOB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 6:7" />Nanm mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:24">Job 3:24</ref></char></note>p ap touche yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:7">Yo tankou manje abominab pou mwen.<verse eid="JOB 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 6:8" />“O ke sa m mande ta kab rive,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:8">e ke Bondye ta ban m sa m anvi wè a!<verse eid="JOB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 6:9" />Ke Bondye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:15">Nonb 11:15</ref></char></note>ta dakò pou kraze m nèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:9">ke Li ta lache men l pou retire mwen nèt!<verse eid="JOB 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 6:10" />Kite sa toujou kòm konsolasyon mwen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:10">wi, kite mwen rejwi nan doulè k ap kraze mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:10">pou m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:22">Job 22:22</ref></char></note>pa t renye pawòl a Sila Ki Sen an.<verse eid="JOB 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 6:11" />Ki jan fòs mwen ye, pou m ta tan?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:11">Epi kilès lafen mwen, ke m ta dwe sipòte?<verse eid="JOB 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 6:12" />Èske fòs mwen tankou wòch,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:12">o èske chè m kon bwonz?<verse eid="JOB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 6:13" />Èske se pa ke nanpwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 26:2">Job 26:2</ref></char></note>sekou anndan m,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:13">ke tout sajès fin chase lwen mwen?<verse eid="JOB 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 6:14" />“Paske pou nonm ki pèdi tout espwa a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:14">li ta dwe twouve konpasyon nan zanmi li;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:14">menm a li menm ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:5">Job 1:5</ref></char></note>kon pèdi lakrent Wo Pwisan an.<verse eid="JOB 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 6:15" />Frè m yo te aji ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:8">Jr 15:8</ref></char></note>desepsyon kon yon ravin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:15">kon flèv ravin ki vin sèch;<verse eid="JOB 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 6:16" />ki vin sal tankou glas k ap fonn</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:16">kote lanèj kon kache.<verse eid="JOB 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 6:17" />Nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 24:19">Job 24:19</ref></char></note>sezon sèch, yo pa la;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:17">lè li cho, yo disparèt sou plas yo.<verse eid="JOB 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 6:18" />Chemen a kous pa yo tòde tout kote;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:18">yo monte rive vin anyen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:18">yo vin disparèt.<verse eid="JOB 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 6:19" />Karavàn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 21:14">És 21:14</ref></char></note>Théma yo te vin veye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:19">vwayajè Séba yo te gen espwa yo.<verse eid="JOB 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 6:20" />Yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:3">Jr 14:3</ref></char></note>te desi paske yo te mete konfyans;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:20">yo te vini la, e te etone.<verse eid="JOB 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 6:21" />Anverite, koulye a se konsa ou ye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:21">ou wè laperèz e ou vin pè.<verse eid="JOB 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 6:22" />Èske mwen te di ou: ‘Ban m yon bagay’?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:22">Oswa m te fè yon demann anba tab pou retire nan richès ou?<verse eid="JOB 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 6:23" />Oswa ‘delivre m nan men advèsè a’?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:23">Oswa ‘rachte mwen nan men opresè sila yo’?<verse eid="JOB 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 6:24" />“Enstwi mwen e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 39:1">Sòm 39:1</ref></char></note>mwen va pe la!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:24">Montre mwen kote mwen gen tò.<verse eid="JOB 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 6:25" />Kèl doulè pawòl onèt sa yo genyen!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:25">Men kisa diskou ou a pwouve?<verse eid="JOB 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 6:26" />Èske ou gen entansyon repwoche pawòl mwen yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:26">lè ou konnen se van ki mèt pawòl yo lè moun dekouraje nèt?<verse eid="JOB 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 6:27" />Konsa, ou ta menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:3">Jl 3:3</ref></char></note>tire osò pou òfelen yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:27">e fè twòk pou zanmi ou.<verse eid="JOB 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 6:28" />Alò, souple, gade mwen e wè si se</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:28">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 27:4">Job 27:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>manti m ap fè nan figi ou.<verse eid="JOB 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 6:29" />Rete la, koulye a e pa kite enjistis fèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:29">Retounen kote m! Jiska prezan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 13:18">Job 13:18</ref></char></note>ladwati mwen rete ladan an.<verse eid="JOB 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 6:30" />Èske gen enjistis sou lang mwen?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:30">Èske bouch mwen pa kapab distenge gou gwo malè?”<verse eid="JOB 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOB 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 7:1" />“Èske lòm pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:7">Job 5:7</ref></char></note>oblije fè kòve sou latè?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:1">Èske jou li yo pa tankou jou a yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 14:6">Job 14:6</ref> </char></note>ouvriye jounalye?<verse eid="JOB 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 7:2" />Tankou esklav ki rale souf pou rive nan lonbraj,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:2">tankou jounalye k ap tann kòb li,<verse eid="JOB 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 7:3" />se konsa mwen jwenn mwa yo plen mizè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:3">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 16:7">Job 16:7</ref></char></note>nwit plen ak gwo twoub k ap dezinyen pou mwen.<verse eid="JOB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 7:4" />Lè m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:67">Det 28:67</ref></char></note>kouche mwen di: ‘Se kilè m ap leve?’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:4">Men nwit lan kontinye; m ap vire tounen jis rive nan maten.<verse eid="JOB 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 7:5" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 2:7">Job 2:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Chè m abiye ak vè ak kal ki fèt ak pousyè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:5">Po m vin di e li koule pij.<verse eid="JOB 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 7:6" />Jou m yo mache <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:25">Job 9:25</ref></char></note>pi vit ke mach aparèy tise a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:6">Yo fini <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 13:15">Job 13:15</ref></char></note>sanzespwa.<verse eid="JOB 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 7:7" />Sonje byen ke lavi m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:39">Sòm 78:39</ref></char></note>pa plis ke yon souf;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:7">zye m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:25">Job 9:25</ref></char></note>p ap wè sa ki bon ankò.<verse eid="JOB 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 7:8" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 8:18">Job 8:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Zye a sila ki wè m yo, p ap wè m ankò.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:8">Zye Ou va sou mwen, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 7:21">Job 7:21</ref></char></note>mwen p ap la ankò.<verse eid="JOB 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 7:9" />Jan yon nwaj vin disparèt, li ale nèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:9">Konsa sila ki desann nan sejou lanmò a pa p monte ankò.<verse eid="JOB 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 7:10" />Li p ap retounen ankò lakay li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:10">ni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 8:18">Job 8:18</ref></char></note>plas li p ap rekonèt li ankò.<verse eid="JOB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 7:11" />“Akoz sa a, mwen p ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 10:1">Job 10:1</ref></char></note>met fren nan bouch mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:11">Mwen va pale nan doulè lespri m;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:11">mwen va plenyen nan lespri anmè mwen.<verse eid="JOB 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 7:12" />Èske se lanmè mwen ye, oswa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 32:2-3">Éz 32:2-3</ref></char></note>bèt jeyan lanmè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:12">pou Ou te mete gad sou mwen?<verse eid="JOB 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 7:13" />Si mwen di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 7:4">Job 7:4</ref></char></note>‘Kabann mwen va ban m repo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:13">sofa m va soulaje plent mwen,’<verse eid="JOB 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 7:14" />answit, Ou fè m krent ak rèv,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:14">e teworize m ak vizyon;<verse eid="JOB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 7:15" />jiskaske nanm mwen ta chwazi mouri toufe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:15">pito lanmò olye doulè mwen yo.<verse eid="JOB 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 7:16" />Mwen fin epwize nèt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:16">mwen p ap viv tout tan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:16">Kite mwen sèl, paske jou mwen yo pa plis ke yon souf.<verse eid="JOB 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 7:17" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 8:4">Sòm 8:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kisa lòm ye pou Ou reflechi sou li</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:17">e pou Ou bay ka li enpòtans,<verse eid="JOB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 7:18" />pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 14:3">Job 14:3</ref></char></note>Ou fè l pase egzamen chak maten e</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:18">fè l pase eprèv chak moman?<verse eid="JOB 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 7:19" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:18">Job 9:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Èske Ou p ap janm sispann gade m,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:19">ni kite mwen anpè jiskaske m fin vale krache m?<verse eid="JOB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 7:20" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 35:3-6">Job 35:3-6</ref> </char>
    </note>Èske mwen te peche? Kisa mwen te fè Ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:20">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 36:6">Sòm 36:6</ref> </char>
    </note>Ou menm, ki gadyen lòm?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:20">Poukisa Ou te fè m objè tiraj Ou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:20">jiskaske mwen vin yon fado pou pwòp tèt mwen?<verse eid="JOB 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 7:21" />Poukisa konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:28">Job 9:28</ref></char></note>Ou pa padone transgresyon mwen yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:21">e retire inikite mwen yo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:21">Paske koulye a, mwen va kouche nan pousyè a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:21">Ou va chache pou mwen, men m p ap la ankò.”<verse eid="JOB 7:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOB 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 8:1" />Konsa, Bildad Schuach la, te reponn:<verse eid="JOB 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 8:2" />“Pou konbyen de tan ou va pale bagay sa yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:2">pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 6:26">Job 6:26</ref></char></note>pawòl a bouch ou fè gwo van?<verse eid="JOB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 8:3" />Èske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:25">Jen 18:25</ref></char></note>Bondye konn konwonpi jistis la?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:3">Oswa èske Toupwisan an konwonpi sa ki dwat?<verse eid="JOB 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 8:4" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 1:5-19">Job 1:5-19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Si fis ou yo te peche kont Li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:4">alò, Li livre yo antre nan pouvwa transgresyon yo.<verse eid="JOB 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 8:5" />Si ou ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:17-27">Job 5:17-27</ref></char></note>chache Bondye e mande</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:5">konpasyon a Toupwisan an,<verse eid="JOB 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 8:6" />si ou te san tach e dwat;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:6">anverite, koulye a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:6">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 22:27">Job 22:27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Li ta leve Li menm pou ou e rekonpanse ou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:6">jan ou te ye nan ladwati ou.<verse eid="JOB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 8:7" />Malgre, kòmansman ou pa t remakab,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:7">ou ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 42:12">Job 42:12</ref></char></note>fini avèk anpil gwo bagay.<verse eid="JOB 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 8:8" />“Souple, fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:32">Det 4:32</ref></char></note>rechèch nan jenerasyon zansèt ansyen yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:8">e bay konsiderasyon a bagay ke papa yo te twouve.<verse eid="JOB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 8:9" />Paske nou menm se sèl bagay ayè nou konnen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:9">e nou pa konnen anyen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:9">paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 14:2">Job 14:2</ref></char></note>jou pa nou yo sou latè</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:9">se sèl yon lonbraj ki pase.<verse eid="JOB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 8:10" />Èske yo p ap enstwi ou, pale ou e</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:10">fè pawòl ki nan tèt yo vin parèt?<verse eid="JOB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 8:11" />“Èske jon kab grandi san ma dlo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:11">Èske wozo konn pouse san dlo?<verse eid="JOB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 8:12" />Pandan li toujou vèt e san koupe a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:12">l ap fennen avan tout lòt plant yo.<verse eid="JOB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 8:13" />Se konsa chemen a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 9:17">Sòm 9:17</ref></char></note>tout moun ki bliye Bondye yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:13">Konsa espwa a moun enkwayan yo peri,<verse eid="JOB 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 8:14" />sila a ak konfyans frajil la</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:14">kap mete konfyans li nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:5-6">És 59:5-6</ref></char></note> fil arenye a.<verse eid="JOB 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 8:15" />Arenye a mete konfyans sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 8:22">Job 8:22</ref></char></note>lakay li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:15">men li p ap kanpe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:15">Li kenbe rèd sou li, men li p ap dire.<verse eid="JOB 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 8:16" />Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 37:35">Sòm 37:35</ref></char></note>byen reyisi nan solèy la e</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:16">gaye toupatou nan jaden an.<verse eid="JOB 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 8:17" />Rasin li yo vlope toupatou sou pil wòch;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:17">li sezi yon kay wòch.<verse eid="JOB 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 8:18" />Si li vin deplase sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 7:10">Job 7:10</ref></char></note>plas li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:18">alò plas li va refize rekonèt li e di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:18">“Mwen pa t janm wè w.<verse eid="JOB 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 8:19" />Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 20:5">Job 20:5</ref></char></note>se sa ki fè lajwa chemen li;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:19">epi dèyè li, gen lòt yo k ap pete sòti nan pousyè tè la.<verse eid="JOB 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 8:20" />“Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:7">Job 4:7</ref></char></note>Bondye p ap rejte yon nonm entèg;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:20">ni li p ap bay soutyen a malfektè yo.<verse eid="JOB 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 8:21" />Jiska prezan, Li va ranpli <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:22">Job 5:22</ref></char></note>bouch ou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:21">avèk ri lajwa e lèv ou avèk kri plezi.<verse eid="JOB 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 8:22" />Sila ki rayi ou yo va vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 132:18">Sòm 132:18</ref></char></note>abiye ak wont</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:22">e tant a mechan yo p ap la ankò.”<verse eid="JOB 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOB 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 9:1" />Konsa, Job te reponn. Li te di:<verse eid="JOB 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 9:2" />“Anverite, mwen konnen sa se vrè;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:2">alò, kijan yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:17">Job 4:17</ref></char></note>nonm kapab genyen dwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:2">devan Bondye?<verse eid="JOB 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 9:3" />Si yon moun te vle <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 10:2">Job 10:2</ref></char></note>diskite avèk Li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:3">li pa t ap kab byen reponn li menm yon fwa nan mil.<verse eid="JOB 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 9:4" />Bondye saj nan kè e pwisan nan fòs;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:4">se kilès ki konn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 13:2">II Kwo 13:2</ref></char></note>reziste ak Li san donmaj?<verse eid="JOB 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 9:5" />Se Li Menm ki deplase mòn yo, ki jan yo pa menm konnen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:5">lè Li boulvèse yo nan fachez Li.<verse eid="JOB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 9:6" />Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:19">És 2:19</ref></char></note>souke latè sòti nan plas li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:6">e fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 75:3">Sòm 75:3</ref></char></note>pilye fondasyon li yo tranble.<verse eid="JOB 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 9:7" />Li kòmande <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">És 13:10</ref></char></note>solèy la pou l pa klere</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:7">e ki mete yon so sou zetwal yo.<verse eid="JOB 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 9:8" />Se Li menm sèl ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:2">Sòm 104:2</ref></char></note>rale lonje syèl yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:8">e bese vag lanmè yo.<verse eid="JOB 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 9:9" />Li sèl ki fè sou syèl la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 38:31-32">Job 38:31-32</ref></char></note> gwo Ourse la ak Orion an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:9">avèk Pleiades yo, avèk chanm ki nan sid yo.<verse eid="JOB 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 9:10" />Li menm ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:9">Job 5:9</ref></char></note>fè gwo bagay mèvèy yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:10">avèk zèv mèvèy san kontwòl yo.<verse eid="JOB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 9:11" />Si Li ta vin pase bò kote mwen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 23:8-9">Job 23:8-9</ref></char></note>mwen pa t ap wè L.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:11">Si Li ta depase m nan wout, mwen pa t ap apèsi L.<verse eid="JOB 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 9:12" />Gade byen, Li rache retire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:12">se kilès ki ka anpeche L?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:12">Kilès ki ka di L: ‘Kisa w ap fè la a’?<verse eid="JOB 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 9:13" />“Bondye p ap detounen kòlè Li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:13">Anba Li, byen akwoupi, se asistan a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 30:7">És 30:7</ref></char></note>Rahab yo.<verse eid="JOB 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 9:14" />Kijan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:3-32">Job 9:3-32</ref></char></note>mwen kab reponn Li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:14">e chwazi pwòp pawòl mwen yo devan L?<verse eid="JOB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 9:15" />Paske malgre mwen te gen rezon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:15">mwen pa t kab reponn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:15">Mwen ta oblije <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 8:5">Job 8:5</ref></char></note>mande gras a Jij mwen an.<verse eid="JOB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 9:16" />Menmsi mwen te rele, e Li te reponn mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:16">mwen pa t ap kab kwè ke Li ta koute vwa m.<verse eid="JOB 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 9:17" />Paske Li fin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 16:12-14">Job 16:12-14</ref></char></note>brize m nèt ak yon tanpèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:17">e ogmante blese mwen yo san koz.<verse eid="JOB 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 9:18" />Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 7:19">Job 7:19</ref></char></note>pa lèse m pran souf,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:18">men fè m debòde ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 13:26">Job 13:26</ref></char></note>sa ki anmè.<verse eid="JOB 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 9:19" />Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:4">Job 9:4</ref></char></note>pou pouvwa, men gade, se Li menm ki gen fòs!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:19">Epi pou jistis, se kilès menm k ap voye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:19">pwosè vèbal bay Li menm?<verse eid="JOB 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 9:20" />Malgre mwen dwat, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:29">Job 9:29</ref></char></note>bouch mwen ap kondane m;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:20">malgre mwen san tò, Li va deklare m koupab.<verse eid="JOB 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 9:21" />Mwen inosan; mwen pa okipe mwen menm;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:21">mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 7:16">Job 7:16</ref></char></note>rayi lavi m.<verse eid="JOB 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 9:22" />“Tout se menm bagay.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:22">Akoz sa mwen di <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 10:7-8">Job 10:7-8</ref></char></note> Li detwi inosan yo avèk koupab yo.’<verse eid="JOB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 9:23" />Si frèt la vin touye sibitman,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:23">l ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 24:12">Job 24:12</ref></char></note>moke dezolasyon inosan an.<verse eid="JOB 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 9:24" />Ak lemonn nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 10:3">Job 10:3</ref></char></note> ki sede nan men a mechan yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:24">Li fin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:17">Job 12:17</ref></char></note>kouvri figi a jij latè yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:24">Si se pa Li menm, eh byen se kilès?<verse eid="JOB 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 9:25" />“Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 7:6">Job 7:6</ref></char></note>jou m yo vin pi rapid pase yon nonm k ap fè kous;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:25">Yo kouri ale. Yo pa wè anyen ki bon.<verse eid="JOB 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 9:26" />Yo glise pase tankou kannòt k ap pase nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 18:2">És 18:2</ref></char></note>wozo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:26">tankou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 1:8">Hab 1:8</ref></char></note>èg ki vole plonje sou viktim li.<verse eid="JOB 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 9:27" />Malgre mwen di ke m va bliye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 7:11">Job 7:11</ref></char></note>plent mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:27">ke m va kite figi tris la pou fè kè kontan,<verse eid="JOB 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 9:28" />mwen krent tout doulè mwen yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:28">Mwen konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 7:21">Job 7:21</ref></char></note>Ou p ap bliye fot mwen yo.<verse eid="JOB 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 9:29" />Mwen gen tan fin jije <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 10:2">Job 10:2</ref></char></note>koupab.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:29">Konsa, poukisa mwen ta dwe fè fòs anven?<verse eid="JOB 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 9:30" />Si m ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:22">Jr 2:22</ref></char></note>lave m nèt ak lanèj,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:30">e pwòpte men m ak savon lesiv ki fò,<verse eid="JOB 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 9:31" />malgre sa, Ou ta plonje mwen nan kanal la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:31">e pwòp rad mwen yo ta vin rayi m.<verse eid="JOB 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 9:32" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 6:10">Ekl 6:10</ref></char></note>Li pa yon nonm kon mwen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:20">Wo 9:20</ref> </char></note>pou m ta reponn Li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:32">pou nou ta kab rive nan tribinal ansanm.<verse eid="JOB 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 9:33" />Nanpwen moun ki pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:19">Job 9:19</ref></char></note>fè antant antre nou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:33">ki ta kab mete men l sou nou toulède.<verse eid="JOB 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 9:34" />Kite Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 13:21">Job 13:21</ref></char></note> retire baton Li sou mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:34">e pa kite laperèz Li plen m ak gwo latèrè.<verse eid="JOB 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 9:35" />Konsa, mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 13:22">Job 13:22</ref></char></note>ta pale san fè laperèz devan L;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:35">men mwen pa kab konsa pou kont mwen.”<verse eid="JOB 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOB 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 10:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 7:16">Job 7:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Mwen rayi pwòp lavi m;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:1">mwen va fè tout fòs <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 7:11">Job 7:11</ref></char></note>plent mwen yo parèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:1">Mwen va pale ak anmè ki fonse nan nanm mwen.<verse eid="JOB 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 10:2" />Mwen va di a Bondye: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:29">Job 9:29</ref></char></note>‘Pa kondane mwen!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:2">Fè m konnen poukisa W ap goumen ak mwen.<verse eid="JOB 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 10:3" />Èske se vrèman bon pou Ou ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:22-24">Job 9:22-24</ref></char></note>oprime;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:3">pou meprize zèv men Ou yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:3">e pou Ou gade ak favè, manèv a mechan yo?<verse eid="JOB 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 10:4" />Èske zye Ou fèt ak chè? Oswa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 16:7">I Sam 16:7</ref></char></note>èske Ou wè</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:4">kon yon nonm wè?<verse eid="JOB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 10:5" />Èske jou Ou yo tankou jou a moun mòtèl,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:5">oswa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 36:26">Job 36:26</ref></char></note>ane Ou yo tankou ane a yon nonm,<verse eid="JOB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 10:6" />pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 14:16">Job 14:16</ref></char></note>Ou ta dwe chache koupabilite mwen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:6">e fè rechèch dèyè peche m?<verse eid="JOB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 10:7" />Malgre Ou konnen mwen pa koupab,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:7">sepandan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:12">Job 9:12</ref></char></note>nanpwen ki ka livre m sòti nan men Ou.’”<verse eid="JOB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 10:8" />“Se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 119:73">Sòm 119:73</ref></char></note>men Ou ki te fòme mwen nèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:8">Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:22">Job 9:22</ref></char></note>èske Ou ta detwi mwen?<verse eid="JOB 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 10:9" />Sonje, souple, ke Ou te fè m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:19">Job 4:19</ref></char></note>kon ajil.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:9">Èske Ou ta fè m retounen pousyè ankò?<verse eid="JOB 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 10:10" />Èske se pa tankou lèt ke Ou te vide mwen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:10">e fè m kaye tankou fwomaj?<verse eid="JOB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 10:11" />Ou te abiye mwen ak po avèk chè</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:11">e koude mwen ansanm nan zo ak gwo venn.<verse eid="JOB 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 10:12" />Ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 33:4">Job 33:4</ref></char></note>ban mwen lavi avèk lanmou dous Ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:12">Se swen Ou ki te konsève lespri m.<verse eid="JOB 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 10:13" />Malgre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 23:13">Job 23:13</ref></char></note>bagay sila yo, Ou te kache yo nan kè Ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:13">Mwen konnen ke sa a se avèk ou:<verse eid="JOB 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 10:14" />si m peche, alò, Ou mete tach sou mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:14">Ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 7:21">Job 7:21</ref></char></note>pa ta akite m de koupabilite mwen.<verse eid="JOB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 10:15" />Si mwen mechan, malè a mwen!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:15">Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 6:29">Job 6:29</ref></char></note>si mwen jis, toujou, menm dwe leve tèt mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:15">Mwen chaje ak wont, e byen rekonnesan a mizè mwen.<verse eid="JOB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 10:16" />Si tèt mwen ta vin leve wo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 38:13">És 38:13</ref></char></note>Ou ta fè lachas</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:16">dèyè m tankou yon lyon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:16">epi ankò, Ou ta montre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:9">Job 5:9</ref></char></note>pouvwa Ou kont mwen.<verse eid="JOB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 10:17" />Ou renouvle <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 1:21">Rt 1:21</ref></char></note>temwayaj Ou kont mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:17">e ogmante kòlè Ou vè mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:17">Dezas monte anwo dezas sou mwen.”<verse eid="JOB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 10:18" />“Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:11-13">Job 3:11-13</ref></char></note>poukisa Ou te fè m sòti nan vant manman m?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:18">Pito ke m te mouri e pa t gen zye ki te wè m!<verse eid="JOB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 10:19" />Mwen te dwe tankou mwen pa t janm te egziste,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:19">kon yon pote sòti nan vant pou rive nan tonbo.<verse eid="JOB 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 10:20" />Èske jou m yo pa kout?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:20">Rete!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:20">Ralanti sou mwen pou m kab jwenn</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:20">yon ti kras kè kontan,<verse eid="JOB 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 10:21" />avan ke m ale—<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 88:12">Sòm 88:12</ref></char></note>pou mwen pa tounen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:21">nan andwa tenèb ak gwo fènwa!<verse eid="JOB 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 10:22" />Nan peyi sa a ki dezole nèt tankou tenèb la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:22">nan fon lonbraj san fòm nan, e ki klere tankou fènwa a.”<verse eid="JOB 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOB 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 11:1" />Epi Tsophar, Naamatit la, te reponn:<verse eid="JOB 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 11:2" />“Èske fòs kantite pawòl sa yo dwe pase san repons?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:2">Eske yon nonm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 8:2">Job 8:2</ref></char></note>pale anpil vin akite?<verse eid="JOB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 11:3" />Èske se akoz ògèy ou ke moun ta dwe rete san pale?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:3">Lè ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 17:2">Job 17:2</ref></char></note>moke, èske nanpwan moun ki pou fè ou wont?<verse eid="JOB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 11:4" />Paske ou te di ‘Lenstriksyon pa m san fot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:4">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 10:7">Job 10:7</ref></char></note>mwen inosan nan zye Ou.’<verse eid="JOB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 11:5" />Men fòk Bondye ta pale e ouvri bouch Li kont ou,<verse eid="JOB 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 11:6" />pou montre ou sekrè a sajès!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:6">Paske sajès ki bon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:4">Job 9:4</ref></char></note>gen de bò.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:6">Alò, konnen byen ke Bondye pa t egzije</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:6">tout sa inikite ou merite.<verse eid="JOB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 11:7" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 33:12-13">Job 33:12-13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Èske ou kab dekouvri pwofondè a Bondye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:7">Èske ou kab twouve lizyè a Toupwisan an?<verse eid="JOB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 11:8" />Yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:12">Job 22:12</ref></char></note>wo tankou syèl la; kisa ou kab fè?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:8">Yo pi fon ke sejou lanmò yo, kisa ou kab konnen?<verse eid="JOB 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 11:9" />Mezi li pi long ke latè, e pi laj pase lanmè.<verse eid="JOB 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 11:10" />Si Li pase pa la, oswa fèmen la nèt, oswa konvoke yon asanble,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:10">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:12">Job 9:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>kilès kap anpeche Li?<verse eid="JOB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 11:11" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 34:21-23">Job 34:21-23</ref></char></note>Li konnen moun ki fò,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:11">e Li wè inikite menm san fè ankèt.<verse eid="JOB 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 11:12" />Yon moun ensanse va vin entèlijan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:12">lè pòtre a yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 39:5">Job 39:5</ref></char></note>bourik mawon fèt kon yon moun.<verse eid="JOB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 11:13" />“Si ou ta vle vin bon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:13">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 7:3">I Sam 7:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>dirije kè ou e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 88:9">Sòm 88:9</ref></char></note>lonje men ou vè Li.<verse eid="JOB 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 11:14" />Si se inikite ki nan men ou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:23">Job 22:23</ref></char></note>mete l byen lwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:14">Pa kite mechanste demere nan tant pa ou.<verse eid="JOB 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 11:15" />Konsa, anverite, ou ta kab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:26">Job 22:26</ref></char></note>leve figi ou wo san tach.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:15">Wi, ou va fidèl nèt e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 27:3">Sòm 27:3</ref> </char></note>pa oblije gen lakrent.<verse eid="JOB 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 11:16" />Konsa ou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:16">És 65:16</ref></char></note>bliye twoub ou a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:16">Ou va sonje l tankou dlo ki fin pase.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:16">Se konsa ou ta kab sonje li.<verse eid="JOB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 11:17" />Lavi ou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:26">Job 22:26</ref></char></note>pi klè ke midi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:17">malgre gen fènwa a, lap tankou maten.<verse eid="JOB 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 11:18" />Ou va vin gen konfyans, akoz gen espwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:18">Epi ou va gade toupatou e repoze ou an sekirite.<verse eid="JOB 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 11:19" />Ou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 3:13">So 3:13</ref></char></note>kouche dòmi e okenn moun pa p deranje ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:19">Wi, anpil moun va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:14">És 45:14</ref></char></note> mande favè ou.<verse eid="JOB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 11:20" />Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:65">Det 28:65</ref></char></note>zye a mechan yo va gate,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:20">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 27:22">Job 27:22</ref> </char></note>p ap gen chape pou yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:20">Pou yo, espwa va pou yo kab rann dènye souf yo.”<verse eid="JOB 11:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOB 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 12:1" />Job te reponn:<verse eid="JOB 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 12:2" />Anverite, konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 17:10">Job 17:10</ref></char></note>se nou menm ki se pèp la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:2">Se ak nou menm tout sajès ap mouri!<verse eid="JOB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 12:3" />Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 13:2">Job 13:2</ref></char></note>mwen gen lespri menm tankou ou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:3">mwen pa pi ba pase ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:3">Epi se kilès ki pa konnen bagay parèy a sila yo?<verse eid="JOB 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 12:4" />Mwen se yon blag devan zanmi mwen yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:4">sila ki te fè apèl Bondye a, e Li te reponn li an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:4">Nonm nan ki dwat e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 6:29">Job 6:29</ref></char></note>san tò a vin yon blag.<verse eid="JOB 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 12:5" />Sila ki alèz la ri sou malè a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:5">men l ap tan pye l chape.<verse eid="JOB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 12:6" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:24">Job 9:24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Tant volè a fè pwofi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:6">e sila ki pwovoke Bondye byen alez.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:6">Se nan men yo pote dye pa yo.<verse eid="JOB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 12:7" />“Alò, mande bèt yo menm pou yo kab enstwi ou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:7">ak zwazo syèl yo; kite yo pale ou.<verse eid="JOB 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 12:8" />Oswa, pale ak tè a e kite li enstwi ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:8">Kite pwason lanmè yo fè deklarasyon pou ou.<verse eid="JOB 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 12:9" />Se kilès pami tout sila yo ki pa konnen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:9">ke se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:20">És 41:20</ref></char></note>men SENYÈ a ki fè sa?<verse eid="JOB 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 12:10" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 17:28">Trav 17:28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nan men a Sila poze lavi a tout sa ki viv la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:10">ansanm ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 27:3">Job 27:3</ref></char></note>souf tout limanite a.<verse eid="JOB 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 12:11" />Èske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 34:3">Job 34:3</ref></char></note>zòrèy la pa pase a leprèv tout pawòl,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:11">menm jan ke bouch la goute manje li a?<verse eid="JOB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 12:12" />Sajès rete ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 15:10">Job 15:10</ref></char></note>granmoun;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:12">yon lavi ki long gen bon konprann.<verse eid="JOB 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 12:13" />“Avèk Bondye se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:4">Job 9:4</ref></char></note>sajès ak pwisans.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:13">A Li menm se konsèy avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 11:6">Job 11:6</ref></char></note> bon konprann.<verse eid="JOB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 12:14" />Gade byen, se Li menm ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 19:10">Job 19:10</ref></char></note>detwi; e sa p ap kab rebati.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:14">Li mete yon nonm nan prizon, e nanpwen lage pou li.<verse eid="JOB 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 12:15" />Gade byen, Li anpeche dlo yo, e yo seche nèt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:15">Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:11-24">Jen 7:11-24</ref></char></note>voye yo deyò pou yo inonde latè a.<verse eid="JOB 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 12:16" />Avèk Li menm se fòs ak sajès pwofon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:16">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 13:7-9">Job 13:7-9</ref>
      </char>
    </note> sa ke lòt moun egare ak sila ki egare yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:16">tou de se pou Li.<verse eid="JOB 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 12:17" />Li fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:14">Job 3:14</ref></char></note>konseye yo mache pye atè</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:17">e fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:24">Job 9:24</ref> </char></note>jij yo antre nan foli.<verse eid="JOB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 12:18" />Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 116:16">Sòm 116:16</ref></char></note>detache chenn ki mare wa yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:18">e mare senti yo ak yon sentiwon.<verse eid="JOB 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 12:19" />Li fè prèt yo mache san rad,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:19">e boulvèse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 34:24-28">Job 34:24-28</ref></char></note>sila ki ansekirite yo.<verse eid="JOB 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 12:20" />Li fè moun konfyans pa kab pale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:20">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 17:4">Job 17:4</ref></char></note>retire bon jijman a ansyen yo.<verse eid="JOB 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 12:21" />Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 34:19">Job 34:19</ref></char></note>vide mepriz sou prens yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:21">e lache senti a pwisan yo.<verse eid="JOB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 12:22" />Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:22">Dan 2:22</ref></char></note>devwale mistè ki nan tenèb yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:22">e mennen fènwa pwofon yo antre nan limyè a.<verse eid="JOB 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 12:23" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:3">És 9:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Li fè nasyon yo vin gran, e Li detwi yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:23">Li fè nasyon yo grandi, e Li mennen yo ale.<verse eid="JOB 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 12:24" />Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:20">Job 12:20</ref></char></note>rache lespri a chèf pèp latè yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:24">e fè yo egare nan yon savann san chemen.<verse eid="JOB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 12:25" />Yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:14">Job 5:14</ref></char></note>tatonnen nan fènwa a san limyè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:25">Li fè yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 24:20">És 24:20</ref> </char></note>kilbite tankou moun sou.<verse eid="JOB 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOB 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 13:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 12:9">Job 12:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Veye byen, zye m gen tan wè tout sa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:1">Zòrèy mwen tande e konprann li.<verse eid="JOB 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 13:2" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 12:3">Job 12:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sa ou konnen yo, mwen konnen yo tou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:2">mwen pa pi ba pase ou.<verse eid="JOB 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 13:3" />“Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 13:22">Job 13:22</ref></char></note>mwen ta pale ak Toupwisan an;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:3">mwen vle diskite ak Bondye.<verse eid="JOB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 13:4" />Men nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 119:69">Sòm 119:69</ref></char></note>sal moun ak manti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:4">Se yon bann <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:32">Jr 23:32</ref></char></note>doktè sanzave nou ye.<verse eid="JOB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 13:5" />Oswa pito ke ou ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 13:13">Job 13:13</ref></char></note>rete an silans nèt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:5">ke sa ta sèvi kon sajès ou!<verse eid="JOB 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 13:6" />Souple, tande pawòl mwen, e koute mo a lèv mwen.<verse eid="JOB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 13:7" />Èske ou kab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 27:4">Job 27:4</ref></char></note>pale pou Bondye sa ki pa jis,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:7">e pale sa ki manti pou Li?<verse eid="JOB 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 13:8" />Èske ou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:5">Lev 19:5</ref></char></note>pran ka pa Li?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:8">Èske ou va diskite pou Bondye?<verse eid="JOB 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 13:9" />Èske sa va sòti byen lè Li bay ou egzamen?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:9">Oswa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:16">Job 12:16</ref></char></note>èske ou va twonpe Li</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:9">kon yon moun konn twonpe yon moun?<verse eid="JOB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 13:10" />Anverite, Li va repwoche ou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:10">si ou apye yon bò ak patripri.<verse eid="JOB 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 13:11" />Èske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 31:23">Job 31:23</ref></char></note>majeste Li p ap bay ou lakrent?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:11">Laperèz Li p ap tonbe sou ou?<verse eid="JOB 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 13:12" />Ansyen pwovèb ou yo se pwovèb ki fèt ak sann;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:12">defans ou yo se defans ki fèt ak ajil.<verse eid="JOB 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 13:13" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 13:5">Job 13:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Rete an silans devan m pou m kab pale;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:13">epi kite nenpòt sa ki rive m k ap rive.<verse eid="JOB 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 13:14" />Poukisa mwen ta mete chè m nan pwòp dan m</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:14">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 119:109">Sòm 119:109</ref></char></note>mete lavi m nan men m?<verse eid="JOB 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 13:15" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 7:6">Job 7:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Malgre Li ta touye mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:15">mwen va mete espwa m nan Li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:15">Malgre, mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 27:5">Job 27:5</ref></char></note>fè diskou chemen mwen yo devan L.<verse eid="JOB 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 13:16" />Se sa, anplis, ki va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 23:7">Job 23:7</ref></char></note>delivrans mwen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:16">paske yon enkwayan p ap parèt nan prezans Li.<verse eid="JOB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 13:17" />Koute pawòl mwen byen pre e</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:17">kite deklarasyon mwen yo ranpli zòrèy ou.<verse eid="JOB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 13:18" />Tande koulye a, mwen te prepare ka mwen an;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:18">mwen konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:21">Job 9:21</ref></char></note>mwen va jistifye.<verse eid="JOB 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 13:19" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 50:8">És 50:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Se kilès ki va diskite kont mwen?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:19">Paske konsa, mwen ta rete anpè e mouri.<verse eid="JOB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 13:20" />“Se sèl de bagay pou pa fè mwen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:20">konsa mwen p ap kache devan figi Ou:<verse eid="JOB 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 13:21" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:34">Job 9:34</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Retire men Ou sou mwen e</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:21">pa kite laperèz Ou fè m sezi.<verse eid="JOB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 13:22" />Epi rele e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:16">Job 9:16</ref></char></note>mwen va reponn;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:22">oswa kite m pale epi reponn mwen.<verse eid="JOB 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 13:23" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 7:21">Job 7:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fè m wè fòs kantite inikite mwen yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:23">avèk peche m yo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:23">Fè m rekonèt rebelyon mwen ak peche m yo.<verse eid="JOB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 13:24" />Poukisa Ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 13:1">Sòm 13:1</ref></char></note>kache figi Ou e</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:24">konsidere m kon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 2:5">Lam 2:5</ref></char></note>lènmi Ou?<verse eid="JOB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 13:25" />Èske Ou ta fè yon fèy k ap vole nan van tranble?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:25">Oswa èske Ou va kouri dèyè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:36">Lev 26:36</ref> </char></note>pay van an seche a.<verse eid="JOB 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 13:26" />Paske Ou ekri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:18">Job 9:18</ref> </char></note>bagay anmè kont mwen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:26">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 25:7">Sòm 25:7</ref></char></note>fè m eritye tout inikite a jenès mwen yo.<verse eid="JOB 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 13:27" />Ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 33:11">Job 33:11</ref></char></note>mete pye m nan chenn e</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:27">ou veye tout chemen mwen yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:27">Ou limite distans pla pye m kab rive,<verse eid="JOB 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 13:28" />pandan mwen ap dekonpoze</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:28">kon yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 2:7">Job 2:7</ref></char></note>bagay k ap pouri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:28">kon yon vètman ki manje pa mit.”<verse eid="JOB 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOB 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 14:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 2:23">Ekl 2:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lòm ki fèt de fanm gen vi kout ki plen traka.<verse eid="JOB 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 14:2" />Tankou yon flè, li parèt e li fennen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:2">Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 8:9">Job 8:9</ref></char></note>li sove ale kon lonbraj.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:2">Li pa dire.<verse eid="JOB 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 14:3" />Èske Ou ouvri zye Ou sou li</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:3">pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 143:2">Sòm 143:2</ref></char></note>mennen li an jijman avèk W?<verse eid="JOB 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 14:4" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 15:4">Job 15:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Se kilès ki kab fè pwòp sa ki pa pwòp?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:4">Pèsòn!<verse eid="JOB 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 14:5" />Konsi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 21:21">Job 21:21</ref></char></note>fòs jou li yo avèk Ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:5">fòs mwa li yo avèk Ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:5">Ou te etabli limit li ke li p ap kab depase.<verse eid="JOB 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 14:6" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 7:19">Job 7:19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Retire zye Ou sou li pou l kab pran repò,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:6">jiskaske li kab konplete jou li yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:6">kon yon ouvriye jounalye.<verse eid="JOB 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 14:7" />Gen espwa pou yon pyebwa lè l koupe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:7">li kab boujonnen ankò,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:7">nouvo boujon yo kab reyisi.<verse eid="JOB 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 14:8" />Malgre rasin li yo vin vye nan tè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:8">e chouk li mouri nan tè sèch,<verse eid="JOB 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 14:9" />fè rive yon gout dlo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:9">e li va pete pouse boujon yo kon yon plant.<verse eid="JOB 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 14:10" />Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:13">Job 3:13</ref></char></note>lòm mouri pou kouche plat.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:10">Lòm mouri e kibò li ye?<verse eid="JOB 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 14:11" />Tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 19:5">És 19:5</ref></char></note>dlo lanmè fè vapè monte</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:11">e rivyè a vin sèch,<verse eid="JOB 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 14:12" />konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:13">Job 3:13</ref></char></note>lòm kouche, e li pa leve ankò.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:12">Jiskaske syèl yo vin disparèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:12">li p ap reveye, ni leve ankò.<verse eid="JOB 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 14:13" />O ke ou ta kapab kache mwen nan sejou lanmò an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:13">pou ou ta kapab fè m kache <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 26:20">És 26:20</ref></char></note>jiskaske chalè Ou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:13">retounen kote Ou!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:13">Ke Ou ta fikse yon limit pou mwen, e sonje m!<verse eid="JOB 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 14:14" />Si yon nonm mouri, èske li va leve ankò?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:14">Pou tout jou a lit mwen yo, mwen ta tann</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:14">jiskaske lè rive pou yo lage m.<verse eid="JOB 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 14:15" />Ou ta rele e mwen ta reponn Ou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:15">Konsa, Ou ta anvi anpil <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 10:3">Job 10:3</ref></char></note>zèv men Ou yo.<verse eid="JOB 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 14:16" />Paske koulye a, ou konte tout pa mwen fè yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:16">Èske Ou pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 10:6">Job 10:6</ref></char></note>swiv peche m yo?<verse eid="JOB 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 14:17" />Transgresyon mwen yo sele nèt nan yon sachè</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:17">Konsa, Ou vlope tout inikite m yo.<verse eid="JOB 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 14:18" />Men mòn nan kap tonbe pa mòso pa fè anyen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:18">wòch la ap kite plas li.<verse eid="JOB 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 14:19" />Dlo a epwize wòch yo, gran fòs li lave pousyè tè a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:19">Se konsa Ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 7:6">Job 7:6</ref></char></note>detwi espwa a lòm.<verse eid="JOB 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 14:20" />Ou vin fè l soumèt nèt pou tout tan, e li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:20">Job 4:20</ref></char></note>pati;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:20">Ou chanje aparans li, e voye l ale.<verse eid="JOB 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 14:21" />Fis li yo vin resevwa lonè, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 9:5">Ekl 9:5</ref></char></note>li menm pa konnen sa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:21">oswa fis li yo vin pa anyen, men li pa apèsi sa.<verse eid="JOB 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 14:22" />Men kò l fè mal;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:22">epi li fè dèy sèlman pou pwòp tèt li.<verse eid="JOB 14:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOB 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 15:1" />Epi Éliphaz Temanit lan te reponn:<verse eid="JOB 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 15:2" />Èske yon nonm saj ta dwe bay repons</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:2">ak konesans ki sòti nan van,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:2">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 6:26">Job 6:26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>e ki plen tèt li avèk van lès?<verse eid="JOB 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 15:3" />Èske li ta diskite ak pale initil,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:3">oswa ak pawòl ki pa gen valè?<verse eid="JOB 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 15:4" />Anverite, ou manke respè Bondye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:4">e ou siprime tout kalite bon refleksyon devan Bondye.<verse eid="JOB 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 15:5" />Paske se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:5">Job 22:5</ref></char></note>koupabilite ou ki enstwi bouch ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:5">e ou chwazi langaj a rizye yo.<verse eid="JOB 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 15:6" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 18:7">Job 18:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pwòp bouch ou kondane ou, pa mwen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:6">epi pwòp lèv ou fè temwayaj kont ou.<verse eid="JOB 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 15:7" />“Èske se ou ki te premye la ki te fèt sou tè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:7">oswa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 38:4-21">Job 38:4-21</ref></char></note>èske ou te fèt avan tout kolin yo?<verse eid="JOB 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 15:8" />Èske ou konn tande <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:34">Wo 11:34</ref></char></note>konsèy sekrè a Bondye yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:8">oswa èske tout sajès se pou ou sèl?<verse eid="JOB 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 15:9" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 12:3">Job 12:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kisa ou konnen ke nou pa konnen?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:9">Èske ou konprann sa nou pa kapab konprann?<verse eid="JOB 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 15:10" />Genyen ni granmoun ak moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:12">Job 12:12</ref></char></note>cheve blanch pami nou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:10">ki pi gran pase papa ou.<verse eid="JOB 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 15:11" />Èske konsolasyon Bondye a twò piti pou ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:11">menm mo ki pale ak dousè avèk ou yo?<verse eid="JOB 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 15:12" />Poukisa a<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 11:13">Job 11:13</ref></char></note>kè ou pote ou rive lwen konsa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:12">Epi poukisa zye ou yo vin limen konsa?<verse eid="JOB 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 15:13" />Pou ou ta vire lespri ou kont Bondye e</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:13">kite pawòl parèy a sila yo sòti nan bouch ou?<verse eid="JOB 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 15:14" />Kisa lòm nan ye pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 7:20">Ekl 7:20</ref></char></note>li ta kab san tach,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:14">oswa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 25:4">Job 25:4</ref> </char></note>sila ki fèt de fanm nan pou ta kab dwat?<verse eid="JOB 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 15:15" />Gade byen, Li pa mete konfyans menm nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:1">Job 5:1</ref></char></note>sen Li yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:15">e menm syèl yo pa san tach nan zye Li;<verse eid="JOB 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 15:16" />konbyen anmwens, yon moun ki degoutan e konwonpi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:16">lòm ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 34:7">Job 34:7</ref></char></note>bwè inikite kon dlo a!<verse eid="JOB 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 15:17" />“M ap di ou, koute m byen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:17">sa mwen konn wè, anplis m ap deklare li;<verse eid="JOB 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 15:18" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 8:8">Job 8:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>sa ke moun saj konn pale</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:18">e ki pa t kache sòti de papa pa yo,<verse eid="JOB 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 15:19" />A sila yo menm sèl ke tè a te donnen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:19">e pa t gen etranje ki te pase pami yo.<verse eid="JOB 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 15:20" />Moun mechan an vire tounen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 15:24">Job 15:24</ref></char></note>nan pwòp doulè li tout tan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:20">e fòs lane pou moun mechan yo byen kontwole.<verse eid="JOB 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 15:21" />Bri laperèz sone nan zòrèy li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:21">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 20:21">Job 20:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pandan li anpè, destriktè a rive sou li.<verse eid="JOB 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 15:22" />Li pa gen espwa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 15:30">Job 15:30</ref></char></note>sòti nan tenèb la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:22">Desten li se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 19:29">Job 19:29</ref> </char></note>nepe.<verse eid="JOB 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 15:23" />Li mache egare pou chache manje epi di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:23">‘Kote li ye?’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:23">Konsa, li konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 15:22-30">Job 15:22-30</ref></char></note>jou tenèb la gen tan rive.<verse eid="JOB 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 15:24" />Twoub ak gwo soufrans fè l gen gwo laperèz.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:24">Yo fè l soumèt tankou yon wa ke yo prèt pou atake.<verse eid="JOB 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 15:25" />Paske li fin lonje men l kont Bondye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:25">e aji ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 36:9">Job 36:9</ref></char></note>awogans kont Toupwisan an.<verse eid="JOB 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 15:26" />Li kouri kou rèd sou li tèt avan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:26">avèk gwo boukliye li.<verse eid="JOB 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 15:27" />Paske li fin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 73:7">Sòm 73:7</ref></char></note>kouvri figi li ak grès li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:27">e fè kwis li vin lou ak chè.<verse eid="JOB 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 15:28" />Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:14">Job 3:14</ref></char></note>viv nan vil dezole yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:28">nan kay kote pèsòn pa ta rete yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:28">ki fèt pou vin dekonble nèt.<verse eid="JOB 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 15:29" />Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 27:16-17">Job 27:16-17</ref></char></note>p ap vin rich, ni fòtin li p ap dire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:29">tèt sereyal li yo p ap janm bese rive atè.<verse eid="JOB 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 15:30" />Li p ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:14">Job 5:14</ref></char></note>chape nan tenèb la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:30">Flanm nan va seche tout boujon li yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:30">Kon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:9">Job 4:9</ref></char></note>souf bouch li, lap wale nèt.<verse eid="JOB 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 15:31" />Pa kite li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 35:13">Job 35:13</ref></char></note>mete konfyans nan gwo vid la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:31">Sa a ta yon desepsyon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:31">paske gwo vid la va sèvi kon rekonpans li.<verse eid="JOB 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 15:32" />Sa va vin rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:16">Job 22:16</ref></char></note>avan lè li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:32">Branch palmis li p ap vèt.<verse eid="JOB 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 15:33" />Li va souke retire rezen li ki potko mi soti nan pye rezen a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:33">e va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 14:2">Job 14:2</ref></char></note>jete flè li kon pye oliv la.<verse eid="JOB 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 15:34" />Paske konpanyen a enkwayan yo va byen esteril,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:34">epi se dife kap brile tant anba pwès yo.<verse eid="JOB 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 15:35" />Yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 7:14">Sòm 7:14</ref></char></note> plante mal la, e yo rekòlte inikite;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:35">epi se desepsyon k ap jèmen nan panse yo.”<verse eid="JOB 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOB 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 16:1" />Epi Job te reponn:<verse eid="JOB 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 16:2" />Mwen tande anpil bagay parèy a sila yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:2">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 13:4">Job 13:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>move konsolatè nou tout ye.<verse eid="JOB 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 16:3" />Èske pa gen limit sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 6:26">Job 6:26</ref></char></note>pawòl kap pouse van a?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:3">Oswa se kilès k ap toumante ou ki fè ou reponn?<verse eid="JOB 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 16:4" />Mwen osi ta kab pale tankou ou, si mwen te nan plas ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:4">Mwen ta kab konpoze pawòl yo kont ou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:4">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 2:15">So 2:15</ref></char></note>souke tèt mwen sou ou.<verse eid="JOB 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 16:5" />Mwen ta kab ranfòse ou ak bouch mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:5">e senpati a lèv mwen ta kab redwi doulè ou.<verse eid="JOB 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 16:6" />Mem si mwen pale sa pa redwi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:27-28">Job 9:27-28</ref></char></note>doulè m;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:6">si mwen ralanti nan pale, se kisa ki kite mwen?<verse eid="JOB 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 16:7" />Men koulye a, Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 7:3">Job 7:3</ref></char></note>fin fatige m nèt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:7">Ou, Bondye, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 19:13-15">Job 19:13-15</ref></char></note>gate tout zanmi m yo.<verse eid="JOB 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 16:8" />Ou te fè m vin sèch nèt. Sa devni yon temwen kont mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:8">Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 19:20">Job 19:20</ref></char></note>jan mwen vin mèg, leve kont mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:8">Li fè temwayaj devan figi mwen.<verse eid="JOB 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 16:9" />Kòlè Li fin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:1">Os 6:1</ref></char></note>chire mwen e chase m jis atè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:9">Li te modi blese m ak dan L.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:9">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 13:24">Job 13:24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Advèsè mwen an chase mwen ak menas Li.<verse eid="JOB 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 16:10" />Yo te gade m, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:14">Sòm 22:14</ref></char></note>bouch yo louvri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:10">Yo te souflete m sou machwè m ak mepriz;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:10">yo te oganize yo menm kont mwen.<verse eid="JOB 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 16:11" />Bondye te plase mwen nan men enkwayan yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:11">e te jete mwen nan men a mechan yo.<verse eid="JOB 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 16:12" />Mwen te alèz, men Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:17">Job 9:17</ref></char></note>brize mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:12">Li te sezi mwen nan kou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:12">e te souke mwen jiskaske m fè mòso;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:12">anplis li te fè m objè tiraj.<verse eid="JOB 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 16:13" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 6:4">Job 6:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Flèch Li yo antoure mwen. San pitye Li fann ren mwen ouvri nèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:13">Li vide <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 20:25">Job 20:25</ref></char></note>fyèl mwen atè.<verse eid="JOB 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 16:14" />Li kase antre brèch pa brèch;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:14">Li kouri sou mwen kon yon jeyan.<verse eid="JOB 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 16:15" />Mwen te koud twal sak sou kò m</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:15">epi pouse kòn mwen antre nan pousyè.<verse eid="JOB 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 16:16" />Figi mwen vin wouj akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 16:20">Job 16:20</ref></char></note>kri mwen yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:16">e pòpyè zye m vin fonse nwa,<verse eid="JOB 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 16:17" />Malgre nanpwen vyolans nan men m,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:17">e priyè mwen yo san tach.<verse eid="JOB 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 16:18" />O latè a, pa kouvri san kò mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:18">Pa bay plas pou kriyè m yo pran repo.<verse eid="JOB 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 16:19" />Menm koulye a, gade byen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:19">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 1:9">Wo 1:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>temwen m se nan syèl la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:19">Avoka m ki pale pou mwen la, an anwo.<verse eid="JOB 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 16:20" />Se zanmi mwen yo k ap moke m.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:20">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 17:7">Job 17:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Zye m kriye a Bondye.<verse eid="JOB 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 16:21" />O ke yon nonm ta kab plede avèk Bondye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:21">kon yon moun plede ak vwazen li!<verse eid="JOB 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 16:22" />Paske lè kèk ane fin pase, m ap prale</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:22">nan chemen ki pap retounen an.<verse eid="JOB 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOB 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 17:1" />“Lespri m fin kase.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:1">Jou m yo etenn;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:1">tonbo a pare pou mwen.<verse eid="JOB 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 17:2" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 12:4">Job 12:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Anverite mokè yo avè m,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:2">e zye m fikse sou pwovokasyon yo.<verse eid="JOB 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 17:3" />“Depoze la koulye a, yon sekirite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:3">Kanpe kon garanti mwen, ak Ou menm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:3">Se kilès ki kab antann avè m?<verse eid="JOB 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 17:4" />Paske Ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:20">Job 12:20</ref></char></note>anpeche kè yo konprann;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:4">pou sa, ou pa p egzalte yo.<verse eid="JOB 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 17:5" />Sila ki enfòme kont zanmi li yo pou piyaj la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:5">menm zye pitit li yo va vin gate.<verse eid="JOB 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 17:6" />“Men Li te fè m vin tounen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 17:2">Job 17:2</ref></char></note>vye pwovèb pou pèp la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:6">Konsa, yo vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 30:10">Job 30:10</ref></char></note>krache sou figi m.<verse eid="JOB 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 17:7" />Anplis, zye m vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 16:16">Job 16:16</ref></char></note>pa wè klè akoz doulè m,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:7">e tout nanm mwen tankou lonbraj.<verse eid="JOB 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 17:8" />Moun ladwati va byen twouble ak sa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:8">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:19">Job 22:19</ref></char></note>linosan an va leve li menm kont enkwayan yo.<verse eid="JOB 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 17:9" />Malgre, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 4:18">Pwov 4:18</ref></char></note>moun dwat la va kenbe chemen li</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:9">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:30">Job 22:30</ref></char></note>sila ki gen men pwòp yo va vin pi fò e pi fò.<verse eid="JOB 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 17:10" />Men nou tout, retounen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:10">malgre mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:12">Job 12:12</ref></char></note>pa twouve yon nonm saj pami nou.<verse eid="JOB 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 17:11" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 7:6">Job 7:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jou pa m yo fin pase, plan mwen yo vin chire nèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:11">menm dezi a kè mwen yo.<verse eid="JOB 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 17:12" />Yo fè lannwit mwen vin sanble lajounen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:12">Yo di ‘limyè a toupre’ lè tout se fènwa.<verse eid="JOB 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 17:13" />Si mwen chache <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:13">Job 3:13</ref></char></note>Sejou mò yo kon lakay mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:13">si mwen fè kabann mwen nan tenèb la;<verse eid="JOB 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 17:14" />Si mwen kriye a fòs tonbo a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:14">‘Se ou ki papa m’; epi a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 21:26">Job 21:26</ref></char></note>vè a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:14">“Ou se manman m ak sè m’;<verse eid="JOB 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 17:15" />Alò, koulye a, se kibò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 7:6">Job 7:6</ref></char></note>espwa mwen ye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:15">Epi se kilès k ap okipe espwa m?<verse eid="JOB 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 17:16" />Èske espwa m va desann avèk mwen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:16">nan Sejou Lanmò yo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:16">Èske se ansanm n ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:17">Job 3:17</ref></char></note>desann nan pousyè a?”<verse eid="JOB 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOB 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 18:1" />Epi Bildad, Shuach la te reponn:<verse eid="JOB 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 18:2" />“Pou jiskilè ou va chase pawòl?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:2">Montre bon sans ou pou nou kab pale.<verse eid="JOB 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 18:3" />Poukisa nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 73:22">Sòm 73:22</ref></char></note>gade tankou bèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:3">tankou sòt nan zye ou?<verse eid="JOB 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 18:4" />O ou menm ki chire pwòp kò ou menm nan kòlè ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:4">èske se pou lakoz ou menm ke tè a ta abandone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:4">oswa wòch la deplase nan plas li?<verse eid="JOB 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 18:5" />“Anverite, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 21:17">Job 21:17</ref></char></note>limyè a mechan an va etenn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:5">e flanm dife li pap bay limyè.<verse eid="JOB 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 18:6" />Limyè nan tant li an vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:25">Job 12:25</ref></char></note>fènwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:6">e lanp li etenn sou li.<verse eid="JOB 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 18:7" />Gran pa dyanm li yo vin kout,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:7">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 15:6">Job 15:6</ref></char></note>pwòp manèv li a vin desann li.<verse eid="JOB 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 18:8" />Paske li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 24:17-18">És 24:17-18</ref></char></note>tonbe nan pèlen an akoz pwòp pye li</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:8">e li mache sou file a.<verse eid="JOB 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 18:9" />Yon pèlen pran l pa talon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:9">e yon filè vin fèmen sou li.<verse eid="JOB 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 18:10" />Yon pyèj kache pou li nan tè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:10">e yon zatrap sou chemen li.<verse eid="JOB 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 18:11" />Patou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 15:21">Job 15:21</ref></char></note>laperèz fè l sezi e kouri dèyè l</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:11">nan chak pa ke li fè.<verse eid="JOB 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 18:12" />Fòs li vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:21">És 8:21</ref></char></note>epwize e gwo dega parèt akote li.<verse eid="JOB 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 18:13" />Kò li devore pa maladi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:13">premye ne lanmò a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 14:12">Za 14:12</ref></char></note>devore manm kò li yo.<verse eid="JOB 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 18:14" />Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 8:22">Job 8:22</ref></char></note>fin chire soti nan sekirite tant li an</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:14">e yo pran l pou l parèt devan wa laperèz la.<verse eid="JOB 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 18:15" />Anyen pa rete nan tant li ki pou li;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:15">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 11:6">Sòm 11:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>souf gaye toupatou sou abitasyon li.<verse eid="JOB 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 18:16" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:1">Mat 4:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Rasin li vin sèch anba li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:16">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 15:30-32">Job 15:30-32</ref> </char></note>branch li fin koupe pa anwo.<verse eid="JOB 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 18:17" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 34:16">Sòm 34:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Memwa li fin disparèt sou tè a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:17">men li pa gen non nan okenn lòt peyi.<verse eid="JOB 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 18:18" />Li bourade pouse lwen limyè a pou rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:14">Job 5:14</ref></char></note>nan tenèb,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:18">e chase jis deyò mond kote moun rete a.<verse eid="JOB 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 18:19" />Li pa gen ni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 27:14-15">Job 27:14-15</ref></char></note>desandan ni posterite pami pèp li a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:19">ni okenn moun ki rete kote li te demere.<verse eid="JOB 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 18:20" />Sila nan lwès yo vin revòlte de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 50:27">Jr 50:27</ref></char></note>desten li</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:20">e sila nan lès yo vin sezi ak laperèz.<verse eid="JOB 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 18:21" />Anverite, se konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 21:28">Job 21:28</ref></char></note>abitasyon a mechan yo ye a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:21">Sa se plas a sila ki pa konnen Bondye a.”<verse eid="JOB 18:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOB 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 19:1" />Epi Job te reponn:<verse eid="JOB 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 19:2" />Pou konbyen de tan, nou va toumante m,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:2">e kraze mwen avèk pawòl yo?<verse eid="JOB 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 19:3" />Dis fwa sa yo nou te ensilte m;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:3">nou pa menm wont fè m tò.<verse eid="JOB 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 19:4" />Menm si m fè erè, erè sa repoze anndan m.<verse eid="JOB 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 19:5" />Si anverite nou vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 35:26">Sòm 35:26</ref></char></note>ògeye kont mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:5">e fè m wè prèv a gwo wont mwen,<verse eid="JOB 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 19:6" />alò, konnen byen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 16:11">Job 16:11</ref></char></note>Bondye te fè m tò,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:6">e te fèmen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 1:13">Lam 1:13</ref></char></note>pèlen Li an antoure mwen.<verse eid="JOB 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 19:7" />“Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 30:20-24">Job 30:20-24</ref></char></note>mwen kriye: ‘Vyolans!’ Men nanpwen repons.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:7">Mwen rele sekou! Men nanpwen jistis.<verse eid="JOB 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 19:8" />Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:23">Job 3:23</ref></char></note>bare chemen mwen pou m pa kab pase,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:8">e Li te mete fènwa sou pa m yo.<verse eid="JOB 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 19:9" />Li te retire lonè sou mwen e</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:9">te retire kouwòn nan sou tèt mwen.<verse eid="JOB 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 19:10" />Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:14">Job 12:14</ref></char></note>kraze desann mwen tout kote e mwen fin disparèt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:10">Li te dechouke espwa m kon yon pyebwa.<verse eid="JOB 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 19:11" />Anplis, Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 16:9">Job 16:9</ref></char></note>limen lakòlè Li kont mwen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:11">e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 13:24">Job 13:24</ref> </char></note>konsidere m kon lènmi Li.<verse eid="JOB 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 19:12" />Lame Li a vin rasanble pou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:12">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 30:12">Job 30:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>bati chemen pa yo kont mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:12">Yo fè kan kap antoure tant mwen an.<verse eid="JOB 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 19:13" />“Li te retire frè m yo byen lwen mwen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:13">e sila mwen te konnen yo vin separe de mwen nèt.<verse eid="JOB 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 19:14" />Fanmi mwen yo vin fè fayit</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:14">e pi pwòch <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 19:19">Job 19:19</ref></char></note>zami m yo te bliye m.<verse eid="JOB 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 19:15" />Sila ki rete lakay mwen yo ak sèvant mwen yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:15">konsidere m kon yon etranje.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:15">Mwen se yon etranje menm nan zye yo.<verse eid="JOB 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 19:16" />Mwen rele sèvitè mwen an, men li pa reponn;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:16">mwen oblije sipliye l ak bouch mwen.<verse eid="JOB 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 19:17" />Menm souf mwen fè bay ofans a madanm mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:17">e mwen vin abominab a pwòp frè m.<verse eid="JOB 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 19:18" />Timoun yo meprize mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:18">Mwen leve e yo pale kont mwen.<verse eid="JOB 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 19:19" />Tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 38:11">Sòm 38:11</ref></char></note>asosye m yo etone ak krent devan m.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:19">Sila ke m byen renmen yo te vire kont mwen.<verse eid="JOB 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 19:20" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 102:5">Sòm 102:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Zo m yo kole sou po m ak chè m;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:20">se sèl pa po dan m ke m chape lanmò.<verse eid="JOB 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 19:21" />“Gen pitye pou mwen, gen pitye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:21">O nou menm ki zanmi mwen yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:21">paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:11">Job 1:11</ref></char></note>men Bondye vin frape mwen.<verse eid="JOB 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 19:22" />Poukisa n ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 13:24-25">Job 13:24-25</ref></char></note>pèsekite mwen menm tankou Bondye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:22">e pa satisfè ak chè mwen.<verse eid="JOB 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 19:23" />O ke pawòl mwen yo te ekri!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:23">O ke yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 30:8">És 30:8</ref></char></note>enskri nan yon liv!<verse eid="JOB 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 19:24" />Ke avèk pwent plim ak plon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:24">yo te grave sou wòch la jis pou tout tan!<verse eid="JOB 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 19:25" />Men pou mwen, mwen konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 43:14">És 43:14</ref></char></note>Redanmtè mwen an vivan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:25">Epi apre tout sa a, li va vin kanpe sou latè.<verse eid="JOB 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 19:26" />Menm lè po m fin detwi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:26">malgre chè m fin sòti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:26">mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 13:12">I Kor 13:12</ref></char></note>wè Bondye nan chè a;<verse eid="JOB 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 19:27" />ke mwen, mwen menm va wè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:27">ke zye m va wè, e se pa kon yon etranje.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JOB 19:27" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:27">“Kè m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 73:26">Sòm 73:26</ref></char></note>vin fèb anndan m.<verse eid="JOB 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 19:28" />Si nou di: ‘Men kijan nou va pèsekite li!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:28">pwiska rasin ka sa a se nan mwen,’<verse eid="JOB 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 19:29" />fè lakrent <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 15:22">Job 15:22</ref></char></note>nepe a pou kont nou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:29">paske lakòlè Bondye mennen pinisyon nepe a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:29">Fòk nou kab konnen, gen jijman.”<verse eid="JOB 19:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOB 20" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 20:1" />Epi Tsophar, Naamatit lan, te reponn:<verse eid="JOB 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 20:2" />“Akoz sa a, tout refleksyon k ap boulvèse m yo, fè m fè repons,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:2">menm akoz tout anndan m tèlman ajite.<verse eid="JOB 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 20:3" />Mwen tande <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 19:3">Job 19:3</ref></char></note>repwòch ki fè m wont.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:3">Konsa, lespri bon konprann mwen fè m reponn.<verse eid="JOB 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 20:4" />Èske ou pa konnen bagay sa a depi nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 8:8">Job 8:8</ref></char></note>tan ansyen an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:4">depi lòm te mete sou latè,<verse eid="JOB 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 20:5" />Ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 37:35-36">Sòm 37:35-36</ref></char></note>viktwa a mechan yo kout,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:5">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 8:13">Job 8:13</ref></char></note>jwa a enkwayan an se pou yon moman?<verse eid="JOB 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 20:6" />Malgre wotè li ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:13-14">És 14:13-14</ref></char></note>rive nan syèl la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:6">pou tèt li ta touche nwaj yo,<verse eid="JOB 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 20:7" />l ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:20">Job 4:20</ref></char></note>peri nèt tankou fatra.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:7">Sila ki te konn wè li yo va di: ‘Kibò li ye?’<verse eid="JOB 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 20:8" />Li vole ale tankou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 73:20">Sòm 73:20</ref></char></note>rèv, e yo pa kab jwenn li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:8">Menm tankou yon rèv lannwit, li fin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 27:21-23">Job 27:21-23</ref></char></note>chase ale.<verse eid="JOB 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 20:9" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 7:8">Job 7:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Zye ki te wè l la pa wè l ankò,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:9">e plas li a pa gade li ankò.<verse eid="JOB 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 20:10" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 5:4">Job 5:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fis li yo fè byen pou malere yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:10">e men yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 27:16-17">Job 27:16-17</ref></char></note>remèt byen li yo.<verse eid="JOB 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 20:11" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 21:23-24">Job 21:23-24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Zo li yo plen ak fòs jenès li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:11">men li kouche ansanm avè l nan pousyè a.<verse eid="JOB 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 20:12" />“Sepandan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 15:16">Job 15:16</ref></char></note>mechanste dous nan bouch li</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:12">e li kache li anba lang li,<verse eid="JOB 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 20:13" />Li pito mal la, e refize lage l,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:13">men kenbe li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:18-23">Nonb 11:18-23</ref></char></note>nan bouch li,<verse eid="JOB 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 20:14" />men manje nan vant li vire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:14">Li tounen pwazon vipè anndan l.<verse eid="JOB 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 20:15" />Li te vale richès,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:15">men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 20:10-21">Job 20:10-21</ref></char></note>vomi fè yo retounen vin parèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:15">Bondye va fè yo sòti nan vant li.<verse eid="JOB 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 20:16" />Li souse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:24-33">Det 32:24-33</ref></char></note>pwazon koulèv yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:16">lang a vipè a kap touye li.<verse eid="JOB 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 20:17" />Li pa gade <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:13-14">Det 32:13-14</ref></char></note> dlo yo ankò,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:17">ni rivyè ki koule yo ak siwo ak bòl lèt yo.<verse eid="JOB 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 20:18" />Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 20:10-15">Job 20:10-15</ref> </char></note>remèt sa ke li te pran an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:18">Li pa kab vale l.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:18">Afè richès a komès li yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:18">li pa kab menm rejwi de yo.<verse eid="JOB 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 20:19" />Paske li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 24:2-4">Job 24:2-4</ref> </char></note>oprime e abandone malere yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:19">Li te sezi yon kay ke li pa t bati.<verse eid="JOB 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 20:20" />“Akoz li pa t kab kalme kè l,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:20">li pat kab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 5:13-14">Ekl 5:13-14</ref></char></note> kenbe anyen nan sa li renmen.<verse eid="JOB 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 20:21" />Anyen pat rete ke li pat devore;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:21">akoz sa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 15:29">Job 15:29</ref></char></note> byen li yo pat dire.<verse eid="JOB 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 20:22" />Ranpli ak tout bagay li, li va jennen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:22">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 5:5">Job 5:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note> men a tout moun ki soufri yo va vini kont li.<verse eid="JOB 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 20:23" />Lè li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 20:13">Job 20:13</ref></char></note> plen vant li, Bondye va voye kòlè fewòs pa Li sou li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:23">Lapli va tonbe sou li pandan l ap manje.<verse eid="JOB 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 20:24" />Li kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 24:18">És 24:18</ref></char></note> sove ale devan zam fèt ak fè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:24">men banza fèt an bwonz lan va tire frennen l.<verse eid="JOB 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 20:25" />L ap rale sòti parèt dèyè do li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:25">menm pwent glise a soti nan fyèl li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:25">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 18:11-14">Job 18:11-14</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Gwo laperèz va parèt sou li.<verse eid="JOB 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 20:26" />Fènwa nèt rezève kon trezò li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:26">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 15:30">Job 15:30</ref></char></note> flanm dife san van an va devore li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:26">Li va manje tout sa ki rete nan tant li an.<verse eid="JOB 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 20:27" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 31:28">Det 31:28</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Syèl yo va revele inikite li</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:27">e tè a va leve kont li.<verse eid="JOB 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 20:28" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 28:31">Det 28:31</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Riches lakay li va pati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:28">posesyon li yo va ale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 20:15">Job 20:15</ref></char></note>nan jou kòlè Li a.<verse eid="JOB 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 20:29" />Sa se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 27:13">Job 27:13</ref></char></note> pòsyon a moun mechan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:29">k ap sòti nan men Bondye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:29">sa se eritaj ke Bondye òdone pou bay li.”<verse eid="JOB 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOB 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 21:1" />“Konsa, Job te reponn:<verse eid="JOB 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 21:2" />Koute pawòl mwen byen pre;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:2">kite sa sèvi tankou chemen pou konsole.<verse eid="JOB 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 21:3" />Pran pasyans pou m kab pale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:3">epi tann lè m fini pou ou kab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 11:3">Job 11:3</ref></char></note> giyonnen m.<verse eid="JOB 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 21:4" />Pou mwen, èske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 7:11">Job 7:11</ref></char></note> plent mwen an se anvè yon nonm?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:4">Epi poukisa mwen pa ta dwe manke pasyans?<verse eid="JOB 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 21:5" />Gade mwen! Vin etone!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:5">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 18:19">Jij 18:19</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Kouvri bouch ou ak men ou!<verse eid="JOB 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 21:6" />Lè m sonje, mwen twouble.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:6">Chè m vin ranpli ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 55:5">Sòm 55:5</ref></char></note> laperèz.<verse eid="JOB 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 21:7" />“Poukisa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 12:1">Jr 12:1</ref></char></note> mechan yo viv toujou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:7">vin vye e vin pwisan nèt?<verse eid="JOB 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 21:8" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 17:14">Sòm 17:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Desandan yo vin etabli pou yo ka wè yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:8">ak pitit pa yo devan zye yo.<verse eid="JOB 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 21:9" />Lakay yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:6">Job 12:6</ref></char></note> pwoteje kont laperèz,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:9">e baton Bondye pa janm rive sou yo.<verse eid="JOB 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 21:10" />Towo yo toujou kouple san manke.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:10">Vach yo fè pitit e pa fè foskouch.<verse eid="JOB 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 21:11" />Yo mete pitit yo deyò tankou yon bann.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:11">Yo flannen e danse toupatou.<verse eid="JOB 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 21:12" />Yo chante ak tanbouren avèk ap,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:12">e rejwi ak son flit la.<verse eid="JOB 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 21:13" />Yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 21:23">Job 21:23</ref></char></note> pase jou yo nan byen reyisi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:13">Epi konsa yo desann nan Sejou Lanmò Yo.<verse eid="JOB 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 21:14" />Yo di Bondye: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:17">Job 22:17</ref></char></note> ‘Kite nou!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:14">Nou pa menm vle konnen chemen Ou yo.<verse eid="JOB 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 21:15" />‘Se kilès Toupwisan an ye pou nou ta sèvi Li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:15">e ki rekonpans nou ta twouve si nou ta priye anvè Li?’<verse eid="JOB 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 21:16" />Gade byen, bonè pa yo pa rete nan men yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:16">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 22:18">Job 22:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note> konsèy a mechan yo lwen mwen.<verse eid="JOB 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 21:17" />“Èske se souvan ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 18:5-6">Job 18:5-6</ref></char></note> lanp a mechan yo etenn?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:17">Èske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 31:2-3">Job 31:2-3</ref> </char></note>malè konn vin tonbe sou yo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:17">Èske Bondye mezire destriksyon nan lakòlè Li?<verse eid="JOB 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 21:18" />Èske se tankou pay nan van yo ye vrè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:18">pay ke van pouse ale?<verse eid="JOB 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 21:19" />Ou di ke ‘Bondye konsève inikite a yon nonm pou fis li yo.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:19">Kite Bondye rekonpanse li menm pou l konnen sa.<verse eid="JOB 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 21:20" />Kite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:30">Jr 31:30</ref></char></note> pwòp zye pa li wè lè l pouri gate.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:20">Kite li bwè lakòlè Bondye.<verse eid="JOB 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 21:21" />Paske ki konsiderasyon ki genyen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:21">pou lakay sila ki swiv li a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:21">lè fòs kantite mwa li yo vin koupe?<verse eid="JOB 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 21:22" />“Èske gen moun kab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:34">Wo 11:34</ref></char></note>bay Bondye konesans?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:22">Se Li menm ki jije sila anwo yo.<verse eid="JOB 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 21:23" />Yon moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 20:11">Job 20:11</ref></char></note> mouri ak tout fòs li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:23">byen alèz e kal;<verse eid="JOB 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 21:24" />Tout bokal li yo plen lèt</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:24">e tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:8">Pwov 3:8</ref></char></note>mwèl zo l li byen mou,<verse eid="JOB 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 21:25" />Pandan yon lòt mouri ak yon nanm anmè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:25">e pa janm goute nan sa ki bon.<verse eid="JOB 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 21:26" />Ansanm yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:13">Job 3:13</ref></char></note>kouche nan pousyè a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:26">e vè vin kouvri yo.<verse eid="JOB 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 21:27" />“Gade byen, mwen konnen sa ou ap panse</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:27">ak plan nou sèvi pou fè m tò yo.<verse eid="JOB 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 21:28" />Paske ou ap di: ‘Kote kay a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:3">Job 1:3</ref></char></note>prens lan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:28">e kote tant kote mechan an rete a?’<verse eid="JOB 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 21:29" />Èske nou pa janm mande vwayajè yo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:29">Èske nou pa konnen temwayaj yo bay?<verse eid="JOB 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 21:30" />Paske mechan an, li menm, konsève pou gwo jou malè a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:30">Y ap vin parèt nan jou kòlè a.<verse eid="JOB 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 21:31" />Se kilès ki va fè l repwòch pou zak li yo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:31">E kilès ki va rekonpanse li pou sa l fè?<verse eid="JOB 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 21:32" />Pandan l ap pote nan tonbo a, y ap veye tonm li.<verse eid="JOB 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 21:33" />Bòl tè vale a va kouvri l ak tout dousè;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:33">anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:19">Job 3:19</ref></char></note>tout moun va swiv dèyè li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:33">menm ak gran fòs san kontwòl yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:33">yo te ale devan l.<verse eid="JOB 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 21:34" />Konsa, se kijan pou m ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 16:2">Job 16:2</ref></char></note>twouve rekonfò</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:34">nan konsolasyon an ven nou yo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:34">Paske repons nou yo fèt ak manti.”<verse eid="JOB 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOB 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 22:1" />Epi Éliphaz, Temanit lan, te reponn:<verse eid="JOB 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 22:2" />“Èske yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 35:7">Job 35:7</ref></char></note>nonm plen kouraj kapab itil a Bondye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:2">Byen klè yon nonm saj se itil a pwòp tèt li.<verse eid="JOB 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 22:3" />Èske Toupwisan an pran plezi nan ladwati ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:3">oswa twouve pwofi si chemen ou yo san fot?<verse eid="JOB 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 22:4" />Èske se akoz krentif la menm ou gen pou Bondye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:4">ke L ap repwoche ou?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:4">Ke l ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 14:3">Job 14:3</ref></char></note>antre nan jijman kont ou?<verse eid="JOB 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 22:5" />Se pa ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 11:6">Job 11:6</ref></char></note>mechanste ou gran</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:5">e inikite ou yo san limit?<verse eid="JOB 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 22:6" />Paske ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 24:3-9">Job 24:3-9</ref></char></note>pran garanti a frè ou yo san koz</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:6">e te menm retire rad pa yo jis yo vin toutouni.<verse eid="JOB 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 22:7" />A moun fatige yo, ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 31:16-17">Job 31:16-17</ref></char></note>pa t bay dlo pou bwè</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:7">e a grangou yo, ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 31:31">Job 31:31</ref></char></note>refize yo pen.<verse eid="JOB 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 22:8" />Men posede tè a se pou nonm ki pwisan an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:8">e se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 3:3">És 3:3</ref></char></note>moun entèg ki viv ladann.<verse eid="JOB 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 22:9" />Ou te voye vèv yo ale men vid</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:9">e te kraze fòs a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 6:27">Job 6:27</ref></char></note>òfelen yo.<verse eid="JOB 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 22:10" />Akoz sa, pèlen yo antoure ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:10">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 15:21">Job 15:21</ref></char></note>laperèz, sibitman, vin bay ou gwo lakrent,<verse eid="JOB 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 22:11" />oswa se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:14">Job 5:14</ref></char></note>fènwa pou ou pa kab wè</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:11">ak anpil dlo ki kouvri ou.<verse eid="JOB 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 22:12" />“Èske Bondye pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 11:7-9">Job 11:7-9</ref></char></note>nan wotè syèl la?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:12">Menm anplis, gade zetwal byen lwen yo; kijan yo wo!<verse eid="JOB 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 22:13" />Ou di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:15">És 29:15</ref></char></note>‘Kisa Bondye konnen?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:13">Èske Li kab jije nan fènwa pwofon an?<verse eid="JOB 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 22:14" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 26:9">Job 26:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nwaj yo se yon plas pou L kab kache,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:14">pou L pa kab wè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:14">Se anwo plafon syèl la l ap mache.’<verse eid="JOB 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 22:15" />Èske ou va kenbe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 34:36">Job 34:36</ref></char></note>ansyen chemen a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:15">kote mesye mechan yo te mache,<verse eid="JOB 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 22:16" />ki te rachte avan lè yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:16">ki te lese fondasyon ki lave a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:16">retire nèt pa rivyè a?<verse eid="JOB 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 22:17" />Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 21:14-15">Job 21:14-15</ref></char></note>di a Bondye: ‘Kite nou!’,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:17">Epi: ‘Kisa Toupwisan an kab fè pou nou?’<verse eid="JOB 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 22:18" />Sepandan, Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:6">Job 12:6</ref></char></note>ranpli lakay yo ak bon bagay;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:18">men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 21:16">Job 21:16</ref></char></note>konsèy a mechan yo lwen m.<verse eid="JOB 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 22:19" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 52:6">Sòm 52:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Moun ladwati yo wè, yo fè kè kontan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:19">Inosan yo moke yo.<verse eid="JOB 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 22:20" />Yo di: ‘Anverite, advèsè nou yo koupe retire nèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:20">E <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 15:30">Job 15:30</ref></char></note>dife a fin manje retay yo.’<verse eid="JOB 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 22:21" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 34:10">Sòm 34:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Vin konnen L depi koulye a e fè lapè avè L;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:21">se konsa, sa ki bon va rive kote ou.<verse eid="JOB 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 22:22" />Souple, resevwa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 8:10">Job 8:10</ref></char></note>enstriksyon nan bouch Li</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:22">e etabli pawòl Li yo nan kè ou.<verse eid="JOB 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 22:23" />Si ou retounen bò kote Toupwisan an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:23">ou va restore,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:23">si ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 11:14">Job 11:14</ref></char></note>retire inikite a byen lwen tant ou.<verse eid="JOB 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 22:24" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 31:24-25">Job 31:24-25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mete riches ou nan pousyè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:24">lò Ophir a pami wòch kouran dlo yo.<verse eid="JOB 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 22:25" />Alò, se Toupwisan an ki va riches ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:25">e pi bèl ajan pou ou.<verse eid="JOB 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 22:26" />Paske konsa ou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 37:4">Sòm 37:4</ref></char></note>rejwi nan Toupwisan an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:26">e leve figi ou vè Bondye.<verse eid="JOB 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 22:27" />Ou va priye a Li menm, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 34:28">Job 34:28</ref></char></note>Li va tande ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:27">Ou va peye ve ou yo.<verse eid="JOB 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 22:28" />Anplis, ou va fè yon dekrè e li va etabli pou ou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:28">konsa limyè va briye sou wout ou.<verse eid="JOB 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 22:29" />Lè ou santi ou vin ba, alò ou va pale ak konfyans,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:29">e moun ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 4:5">Jc 4:5</ref></char></note>enb lan, Li va sove li.<verse eid="JOB 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 22:30" />Li va delivre menm sila ki pa inosan yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:30">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 42:7-8">Job 42:7-8</ref></char></note>delivrans sa a va fèt akoz men ou ki pwòp.”<verse eid="JOB 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOB 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 23:1" />Alò, Job te reponn:<verse eid="JOB 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 23:2" />Menm jodi a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 7:11">Job 7:11</ref></char></note>plent mwen yo se rebelyon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:2">Men Li rete lou malgre tout plent mwen yo.<verse eid="JOB 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 23:3" />O ke m ta kab konnen kibò mwen ta kab twouve Li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:3">pou m ta kab pwoche chèz Li a!<verse eid="JOB 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 23:4" />Mwen ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 13:18">Job 13:18</ref></char></note>prezante ka m nan devan L,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:4">e plen bouch mwen ak diskou yo.<verse eid="JOB 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 23:5" />Mwen ta vin aprann pawòl ke Li ta reponn yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:5">e apèsi sa Li ta di m.<verse eid="JOB 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 23:6" />Èske Li ta sèvi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:4">Job 9:4</ref></char></note>gran fòs Li pou goumen ak mwen?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:6">Non, anverite, Li ta koute mwen.<verse eid="JOB 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 23:7" />La, moun ladwati yo ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 13:3">Job 13:3</ref></char></note>rezone avè L;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:7">epi mwen ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 23:10">Job 23:10</ref> </char></note>delivre jis pou tout tan de Jij mwen an.<verse eid="JOB 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 23:8" />Men gade, mwen fè avan, men Li pa la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:8">e mwen fè bak, men mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:11">Job 9:11</ref></char></note>pa kab twouve Li.<verse eid="JOB 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 23:9" />Lè L aji agoch, mwen pa kab wè Li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:9">Li vire adwat, mwen pa wè L.<verse eid="JOB 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 23:10" />Men Li konnen chemen ke m pran an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:10">Li fè m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 13:9">Za 13:9</ref></char></note>pase a leprèv, e mwen va sòti tankou lo.<verse eid="JOB 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 23:11" />Pye m te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 31:7">Job 31:7</ref></char></note>kenbe fèm a pa Li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:11">Mwen te kenbe chemen Li an, e mwen pa t vire akote.<verse eid="JOB 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 23:12" />Mwen pa t kite kòmand a lèv Li yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:12">Mwen te kenbe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 6:10">Job 6:10</ref></char></note>pawòl a bouch Li</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:12">kon pi presye pase manje ki fè m gen fòs la.<verse eid="JOB 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 23:13" />Men pa gen lòt tankou Li;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:13">se kilès ki kab kanpe kont Li?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:13">Sa ke nanm Li pito, se sa ke Li fè.<verse eid="JOB 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 23:14" />Paske li acheve sa ki deziye pou mwen an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:14">Se anpil dekrè konsa ki rete avè L.<verse eid="JOB 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 23:15" />Pou sa, mwen deranje nèt nan prezans Li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:15">Lè m kalkile, Li fè m pè anpil.<verse eid="JOB 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 23:16" />Se Bondye ki fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 20:3">Det 20:3</ref></char></note>kè m sote.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:16">Se Toupwisan an ki deranje m konsa.<verse eid="JOB 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 23:17" />Akoz mwen pat koupe retire nèt avan fenwà a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:17">ni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 19:8">Job 19:8</ref> </char></note>Li pat kouvri gwo tenèb la devan figi m.<verse eid="JOB 23:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOB 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 24:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:7">Trav 1:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Poukisa Toupwisan an pa mete tan nan rezèv?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:1">E poukisa sila ki konnen Li yo pa wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:12">És 2:12</ref></char></note>jou Li yo?<verse eid="JOB 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 24:2" />Kèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:14">Det 19:14</ref></char></note>retire limit bòn yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:2">Yo sezi e devore bann mouton yo.<verse eid="JOB 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 24:3" />Yo pouse fè ale bourik a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 6:27">Job 6:27</ref></char></note>òfelen yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:3">yo pran bèf a vèv la kon garanti.<verse eid="JOB 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 24:4" />Yo pouse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 24:14">Job 24:14</ref></char></note>endijan yo akote wout la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:4">Malere peyi a oblije kache nèt.<verse eid="JOB 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 24:5" />Gade byen, kon bourik mawon nan dezè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:5">yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:23">Sòm 104:23</ref></char></note>vin parèt pou chache manje.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:5">Dezè a bay yo anpil manje pou pitit yo.<verse eid="JOB 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 24:6" />Yo rekòlte nan chan a lòt yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:6">e ranmase nan chan rezen a mechan yo.<verse eid="JOB 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 24:7" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 22:26">Egz 22:26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yo pase lannwit lan toutouni san rad,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:7">e yo pa gen pwotèj kont fredi a.<verse eid="JOB 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 24:8" />Yo mouye ak lapli mòn yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:8">e yo anbrase wòch yo akoz mank pwotèj yo.<verse eid="JOB 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 24:9" />Lòt yo sezi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 6:27">Job 6:27</ref></char></note>òfelen an soti nan tete a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:9">e kont malere a, yo pran garanti.<verse eid="JOB 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 24:10" />Se yo ki koz malere a ale toutouni san rad,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:10">kap pote pakèt akoz grangou.<verse eid="JOB 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 24:11" />Anndan miray moun sa yo, yo pwodwi lwil.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:11">Yo foule li nan preswa, men yo swaf.<verse eid="JOB 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 24:12" />Depi nan vil la, moun yo plenyen fò,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:12">e nanm a sila ki blese yo pouse gwo plent,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:12">men Bondye pa prete atansyon de foli sa a.<verse eid="JOB 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 24:13" />“Gen lòt moun ki fè rebèl kont limyè a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:13">Yo pa vle konnen pa li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:13">ni rete nan chemen li yo.<verse eid="JOB 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 24:14" />Asasen an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 2:1">Mi 2:1</ref></char></note>leve granmmaten.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:14">Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 10:8">Sòm 10:8</ref></char></note>touye malere a ak endijan an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:14">Nan lannwit, se yon vòlè li ye.<verse eid="JOB 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 24:15" />Zye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 7:9">Pwov 7:9</ref></char></note>adiltè a tann lannwit rive;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:15">li di: ‘Zye p ap janm wè m.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:15">Li kouvri figi li.<verse eid="JOB 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 24:16" />Nan fènwa, yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:2">Egz 22:2</ref></char></note>fouye anndan kay yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:16">Yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:20">Jn 3:20</ref></char></note>fèmen yo menm pandan jounen an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:16">Yo pa konnen limyè.<verse eid="JOB 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 24:17" />Paske pou li maten se menm jan ak fènwa a byen pwès,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:17">tèlman li abitye ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 15:21">Job 15:21</ref></char></note>gwo perèz nan fènwa pwès la.<verse eid="JOB 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 24:18" />“Se kim yo ye k ap monte sou dlo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:18">Pòsyon pa yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 15:21">Job 15:21</ref></char></note>modi sou latè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:18">Yo pa tankou chan rezen yo.<verse eid="JOB 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 24:19" />Sechrès ak chalè manje dlo lanèj la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:19">Menm jan tou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 21:13">Job 21:13</ref></char></note>Sejou Lanmò fè sila ki te peche yo.<verse eid="JOB 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 24:20" />Vant manman an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:15">És 49:15</ref></char></note>va bliye li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:20">Vè va manje li byen dous,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:20">jiskaske moun pa sonje l ankò.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:20">Konsa, mechanste la va kase tankou yon pyebwa.<verse eid="JOB 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 24:21" />Li fè tò a fanm esteril la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:21">Li pa gen mizerikòd pou li.<verse eid="JOB 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 24:22" />Men Bondye konsève pwisan an pa lafòs Li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:22">Li vin gwo, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 18:20">Job 18:20</ref></char></note>lavi li pa asire.<verse eid="JOB 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 24:23" />Bondye bay yo sekirite e yo repoze ladan l.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:23">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 10:4">Job 10:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Zye Li veye tout sa yo fè.<verse eid="JOB 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 24:24" />Yo leve wo pou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 37:10">Sòm 37:10</ref></char></note>ti tan, e yo ale.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:24">Konsa, yo vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 14:21">Job 14:21</ref></char></note>rale ba e tankou tout lòt bagay, yo pote ale.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:24">Menm tankou tèt sereyal, yo koupe, yo retire.<verse eid="JOB 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 24:25" />Alò, si se pa konsa li ye, se kilès ki kab fè prèv</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:25">ke m bay manti, oswa anile pawòl mwen yo?”<verse eid="JOB 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JOB 25" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 25:1" />Alò, Bildad, Shouachyen an te reponn:<verse eid="JOB 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 25:2" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:4">Job 9:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Tout pouvwa ak lakrent apatyen a Sila</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 25:2">ki etabli lapè nan wotè Li yo.<verse eid="JOB 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 25:3" />Èske fòs kantite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 16:13">Job 16:13</ref></char></note>sòlda Li yo kab kontwole?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 25:3">Epi sou kilès ke limyè Li pa leve?<verse eid="JOB 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 25:4" />Konsa, se kijan yon nonm kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:14-17">Job 4:14-17</ref></char></note>dwat devan Bondye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 25:4">Oswa, kijan sila ki te fèt de fanm nan kapab vin pwòp?<verse eid="JOB 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 25:5" />Nan zye pa Li, menm lalin pa klè, ni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 15:15">Job 15:15</ref></char></note>zetwal yo pa pwòp,<verse eid="JOB 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 25:6" />Konbyen, anmwens <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 7:17">Job 7:17</ref></char></note>lòm, yon vè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 25:6">ak fis la a lòm nan, vè a menm nan!<verse eid="JOB 25:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JOB 26" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 26:1" />Epi Job te reponn:<verse eid="JOB 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 26:2" />Kèl kalite èd ou ye pou fèb yo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:2">Kèl sekou ou te bay a bra ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 71:9">Sòm 71:9</ref></char></note>san fòs la!<verse eid="JOB 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 26:3" />Kèl konsèy ou te bay a sila ki san sajès la!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:3">Kèl kalite bèl eklèsisman ou te bay an abondans!<verse eid="JOB 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 26:4" />Se a kilès ou t ap eksprime pawòl sa yo menm?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:4">Epi se lespri a kilès ki te enspire ou menm?<verse eid="JOB 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 26:5" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 3:13">Job 3:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lespri mò yo tranble anba dlo yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:5">avèk tout sila ki rete ladann yo.<verse eid="JOB 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 26:6" />Sejou Lanmò An se toutouni devan Bondye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:6">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 28:22">Job 28:22</ref> </char>
    </note>Labim nan pa gen kouvèti.<verse eid="JOB 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 26:7" />Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:8">Job 9:8</ref></char></note>lonje rale zetwal nò a sou espas vid.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:7">Li fè mond lan pandye san anyen pap kenbe l.<verse eid="JOB 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 26:8" />Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 37:11">Job 37:11</ref></char></note>vlope dlo yo nan nwaj Li yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:8">e nwaj la pa pete anba fòs yo.<verse eid="JOB 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 26:9" />Li fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:14">Job 22:14</ref></char></note>kache figi gwo lalin nan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:9">e gaye nwaj Li sou li.<verse eid="JOB 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 26:10" />Li te trase yon lizyè sou sifas dlo yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:10">ak pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 38:19-24">Job 38:19-24</ref></char></note>limit tenèb la ak limyè a.<verse eid="JOB 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 26:11" />Pilye syèl yo tanmen tranble,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:11">e yo etone lè L repwòche yo.<verse eid="JOB 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 26:12" />Ak pwisans Li, li kalme lanmè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:12">e ak bon konprann Li, li te brize <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 51:15">És 51:15</ref></char></note>Rahab.<verse eid="JOB 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 26:13" />Ak souf Li, li dekore <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:8">Job 9:8</ref></char></note>syèl yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:13">Se men L ki te frennen sèpan ki t ap sove ale a.<verse eid="JOB 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 26:14" />Gade byen, sa se yon ti kras bagay de tout chemen L yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:14">Epi a la ti kras souf pawòl nou konn tande de Li!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:14">Men tonnè pwisans Li an!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:14">Se kilès ki kab konprann li?<verse eid="JOB 26:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JOB 27" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 27:1" />Alò, Job te kontinye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 13:12">Job 13:12</ref></char></note>diskou li. Li te di:<verse eid="JOB 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 27:2" />Kon Bondye viv la, ki te retire dwa m,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:2">Toupwisan<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:18">Job 9:18</ref></char></note>ki te fè m gen nanm anmè a,<verse eid="JOB 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 27:3" />paske tan lavi toujou nan mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:3">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 32:8">Job 32:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Souf Bondye la nan nen m.<verse eid="JOB 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 27:4" />Lèv mwen, anverite, p ap pale sa ki pa dwat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:4">ni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 6:28">Job 6:28</ref></char></note>lang mwen pa p pale manti.<verse eid="JOB 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 27:5" />Fòk se lwen m pou m ta bay ou rezon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:5">Jiskaske m mouri, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 6:29">Job 6:29</ref></char></note>mwen p ap lage entegrite m.<verse eid="JOB 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 27:6" />Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 2:3">Job 2:3</ref></char></note>kenbe fèm a ladwati mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:6">Mwen p ap lage l menm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:6">Kè m pa repwoche m depi gen lavi ladan m.<verse eid="JOB 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 27:7" />“Kite lènmi m kapab tankou mechan a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:7">Kite sila ki leve kont mwen, san jistis.<verse eid="JOB 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 27:8" />Paske ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 8:13">Job 8:13</ref></char></note>espwa sila ki san Bondye a genyen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:8">lè l koupe retire nèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:8">lè Bondye fè l oblije bay lavi li?<verse eid="JOB 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 27:9" />Èske Bondye va tande kri li lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 1:27">Pwov 1:27</ref></char></note>malè rive li?<verse eid="JOB 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 27:10" />Èske li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 37:4">Sòm 37:4</ref></char></note>pran plezi nan Toupwisan an?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:10">Èske li va rele non Bondye a nan tout tan sa yo?<verse eid="JOB 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 27:11" />Mwen va enstwi ou nan pwisans Bondye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:11">Pwojè Toupwisan an, mwen p ap kache l.<verse eid="JOB 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 27:12" />Gade byen, nou tout gen tan wè sa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:12">Ebyen, poukisa nou aji nan foli?<verse eid="JOB 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 27:13" />“Sa se pòsyon a moun mechan an ki va sòti Bondye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:13">ak eritaj ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 15:20">Job 15:20</ref> </char></note>mechan yo va resevwa nan men Toupwisan an.<verse eid="JOB 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 27:14" />Malgre fis li yo anpil, yo destine pou nepe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:14">Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 20:10">Job 20:10</ref></char></note>desandan li yo ap toujou manke pen.<verse eid="JOB 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 27:15" />Sila ki swiv li yo va antere nan lamò</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:15">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:64">Sòm 78:64</ref></char></note>vèv li yo p ap kriye pou li.<verse eid="JOB 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 27:16" />Malgre li fè gwo pil ajan an vin tankou se tè</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:16">e prepare vètman anpil tankou ajil,<verse eid="JOB 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 27:17" />li kab prepare l, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 20:18-21">Job 20:18-21</ref></char></note>men se moun ladwati yo k ap mete li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:17">se inosan yo k ap divize ajan an.<verse eid="JOB 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 27:18" />Li te bati <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 8:15">Job 8:15</ref></char></note>kay li tankou papiyon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:18">oswa tankou kay poto gadyen te fè.<verse eid="JOB 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 27:19" />Li kouche byen rich, men li pa janm vin genyen ankò;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:19">li ouvri zye li, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 7:8-10">Job 7:8-10</ref></char></note>li pa la.<verse eid="JOB 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 27:20" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 15:21">Job 15:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gwo laperèz yo rive pran l tankou yon flèv.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:20">Yon move tan vole retire l pandan lannwit.<verse eid="JOB 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 27:21" />Van lès la pote l ale e li pati.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:21">Li fè l vire tounen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 7:10">Job 7:10</ref> </char></note>kite plas li.<verse eid="JOB 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 27:22" />Paske l ap plonje sou li san epanye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:22">pandan li eseye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 11:20">Job 11:20</ref> </char></note>envite l chape nan men l.<verse eid="JOB 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 27:23" />Pèp la va bat men yo sou li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:23">Yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 18:18">Job 18:18</ref></char></note>sifle sou li kon koulèv,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:23">pou li kite plas li a.”<verse eid="JOB 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JOB 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 28:1" />Anverite, gen yon min pou ajan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:1">e yon plas pou rafine lò.<verse eid="JOB 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 28:2" />Fè retire nan pousyè a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:2">e kwiv la fonn soti nan wòch la.<verse eid="JOB 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 28:3" />Lòm fè tenèb la pati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:3">e rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 1:13">Ekl 1:13</ref></char></note>jis nan dènye limit lan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:3">Li chache twouve wòch kap kache a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:3">ak nan pwofon fènwa.<verse eid="JOB 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 28:4" />Li fouye yon twou fon byen lwen kote moun rete,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:4">kote ki bliye nèt pa pye moun.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:4">Konsa, yo pandye, yo balanse byen lwen limanite.<verse eid="JOB 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 28:5" />Pou tè a, depi nan li, manje sòti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:5">men anba, li boulvèse tankou dife.<verse eid="JOB 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 28:6" />Wòch li se sous a pyè safi yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:6">Epi nan pousyè li, genyen lò.<verse eid="JOB 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 28:7" />Chemen li pa rekonèt pa koukou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:7">ni zye grigri pa janm wè l.<verse eid="JOB 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 28:8" />Bèt pi fewòs yo pa mache la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:8">ni lyon pa pase sou li.<verse eid="JOB 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 28:9" />Li mete men li sou wòch silèks la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:9">Li chavire mòn yo soti nan baz yo.<verse eid="JOB 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 28:10" />Li kreve kanal ki pase nan wòch yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:10">e zye li wè tout sa ki presye.<verse eid="JOB 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 28:11" />Li bouche flèv yo pou dlo pa koule</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:11">e sa ki kache yo, li fè yo parèt nan limyè.<verse eid="JOB 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 28:12" />“Men se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 28:23-28">Job 28:23-28</ref></char></note>kibò yo twouve sajès?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:12">Epi kibò yo jwenn sajès la?<verse eid="JOB 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 28:13" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:44-46">Mat 13:44-46</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lòm pa konnen valè li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:13">ni valè li pa kab twouve nan peyi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:13">moun vivan yo.<verse eid="JOB 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 28:14" />Labim nan di: “Li pa nan mwen”.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:14">Lanmè a di: ‘Li pa bò kote m’.<verse eid="JOB 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 28:15" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 3:13-14">Pwov 3:13-14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lò pi pa egal ak valè l,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:15">ni ajan pa kab peze kon pri li.<verse eid="JOB 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 28:16" />Valè li pa kab konpare ak lò Ophir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:16">oswa oniks presye, oswa safì.<verse eid="JOB 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 28:17" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 8:10">Pwov 8:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ni lò ni vit pa egal avè l,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:17">ni li pa kab fè echanj pou bagay ki fèt an lò fen.<verse eid="JOB 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 28:18" />Koray ak kristal, bliye sa nèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:18">Posede <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 8:11">Pwov 8:11</ref></char></note>sajès se pi wo ke pèl.<verse eid="JOB 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 28:19" />Topaz a Éthiopie a pa kab konpare avè l;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:19">ni li pa kab valorize an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 8:19">Pwov 8:19</ref></char></note>lò pi.<verse eid="JOB 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 28:20" />E byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 28:23-28">Job 28:23-28</ref></char></note>se kibò sajès la sòti?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:20">Epi kibò anplasman bon konprann nan ye?<verse eid="JOB 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 28:21" />Konsa, li kache a zye de tout èt vivan yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:21">e kache menm a zwazo syèl yo.<verse eid="JOB 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 28:22" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 26:6">Job 26:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Labim nan ak lanmò a pale:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:22">‘Ak zòrèy nou, nou konn tande rapò bagay sa a.’<verse eid="JOB 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 28:23" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:4">Job 9:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Bondye konprann chemen li</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:23">e Li konnen plas li.<verse eid="JOB 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 28:24" />“Paske Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 11:4">Sòm 11:4</ref></char></note>chache jis rive nan dènye pwent latè</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:24">e wè tout bagay anba syèl yo.<verse eid="JOB 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 28:25" />Lè L te bay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 135:7">Sòm 135:7</ref></char></note>pwa a van an</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:25">e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 38:8-11">Job 38:8-11</ref></char></note>divize dlo yo pa mezi,<verse eid="JOB 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 28:26" />Lè L te etabli yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 37:6-12">Job 37:6-12</ref></char></note>limit pou lapli</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:26">e yon chemen pou kout eklè,<verse eid="JOB 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 28:27" />Li te wè l e Li te deklare li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:27">Li te etabli li e anplis, Li te konprann bout li.<verse eid="JOB 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 28:28" />Konsa, a lòm Li te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:28">‘Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 9:10">Pwov 9:10</ref></char></note>lakrent Senyè a, se sa ki sajès;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:28">epi kite mal, se sa ki bon konprann.’”<verse eid="JOB 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JOB 29" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 29:1" />Ankò, Job te reprann <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 23:7">Nonb 23:7</ref></char></note>diskou. Li te di:<verse eid="JOB 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 29:2" />“O ke m te menm jan ke m te ye nan mwa lontan yo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:2">Kon nan jou ke Bondye te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:28">Jr 31:28</ref></char></note>bay rega sou mwen yo;<verse eid="JOB 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 29:3" />Lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 18:6">Job 18:6</ref></char></note>lanp Li yo te briye sou tèt mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:3">e pa limyè Li, mwen te mache pase nan fènwa a;<verse eid="JOB 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 29:4" />Jan mwen te ye nan pi bèl nan jou mwen yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:4">lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 25:14">Sòm 25:14</ref></char></note>amitye Bondye te sou tant mwen an;<verse eid="JOB 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 29:5" />lè Toupwisan an te toujou avè m,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:5">e pitit mwen yo te antoure mwen;<verse eid="JOB 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 29:6" />lè pa mwen yo te benyen nan bè</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:6">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:13">Det 32:13</ref></char></note>wòch la t ap vide ban mwen gwo flèv lwil!<verse eid="JOB 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 29:7" />Lè m te konn sòti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 31:21">Job 31:21</ref></char></note>pòtay lavil la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:7">pou m te gen chèz mwen sou plas la.<verse eid="JOB 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 29:8" />Jennonm yo te wè m, e te kache kò yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:8">e granmoun yo te konn leve kanpe.<verse eid="JOB 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 29:9" />Prens yo te sispann pale</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:9">e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 21:5">Job 21:5</ref></char></note>mete men yo sou bouch yo.<verse eid="JOB 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 29:10" />Vwa a moun pwisan yo te rete,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:10">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 137:6">Sòm 137:6</ref></char></note>lang yo te kole anlè nan bouch yo.<verse eid="JOB 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 29:11" />Paske lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:3-4">Job 4:3-4</ref></char></note>zòrèy la te tande m, li te rele m beni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:11">e lè zye a te wè m, li te fè temwayaj benediksyon,<verse eid="JOB 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 29:12" />akoz mwen te delivre malere ki te kriye pou sekou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:12">avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 31:17-21">Job 31:17-21</ref></char></note>òfelen ki pa t gen moun pou ede l la.<verse eid="JOB 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 29:13" />Benediksyon a sila ki te prèt pou peri yo te rive sou mwen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:13">e mwen te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:9">Job 22:9</ref></char></note>kè vèv la chante avèk jwa.<verse eid="JOB 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 29:14" />Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:10">És 61:10</ref></char></note>abiye nan ladwati e li te kouvri m;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:14">jistis mwen te tankou yon manto, avèk yon tiban.<verse eid="JOB 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 29:15" />Mwen te sèvi kon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 10:31">Nonb 10:31</ref></char></note>zye pou avèg yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:15">e pye pou sila bwate yo.<verse eid="JOB 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 29:16" />Mwen te yon papa pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 24:4">Job 24:4</ref></char></note> malere a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:16">e ka ke m pa konnen an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:16">mwen te chache twouve bout li.<verse eid="JOB 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 29:17" />Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 3:7">Sòm 3:7</ref></char></note>kase machwè a mechan an</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:17">e mwen te retire viktim nan anba dan l.<verse eid="JOB 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 29:18" />Konsa, mwen te reflechi, “Mwen va mouri nan pwòp kay mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:18">e mwen va kontwole jou m yo anpil tankou sab.”<verse eid="JOB 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 29:19" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 14:5">Os 14:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Rasin mwen gaye tankou dlo e lawouze</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:19">kouche tout lannwit sou branch mwen yo.<verse eid="JOB 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 29:20" />Fòs mwen toujou nèf,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:20">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:24">Jen 49:24</ref></char></note>banza m renouvle nan men m.’<verse eid="JOB 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 29:21" />“Moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:3">Job 4:3</ref></char></note>yo te koute e te tann.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:21">Yo te sispann pale pou tande konsèy mwen.<verse eid="JOB 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 29:22" />Apre pawòl pa m, yo pa t pale ankò,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:22">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:2">Det 32:2</ref></char></note>pawòl mwen yo te etonnen yo.<verse eid="JOB 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 29:23" />Yo te tann mwen tankou lapli.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:23">Yo te ouvri bouch yo pou bwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:23">konsi se pou lapli nan sezon prentan.<verse eid="JOB 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 29:24" />Mwen te souri sou yo lè yo pa t kwè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:24">e limyè a figi m pa t janm vin ba.<verse eid="JOB 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 29:25" />Mwen te chwazi yon chemen pou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:25">te chita tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:3">Job 1:3</ref></char></note>chèf,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:25">e te demere tankou wa pami sòlda yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:25">tankou yon moun ki bay rekonfò a sila ki andèy yo.”<verse eid="JOB 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JOB 30" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 30:1" />Men koulye a, sila ki pi jenn pase m ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:4">Job 12:4</ref></char></note>giyonnen m.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:1">Papa a sila mwen pat ta dakò pou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:1">mete ansanm ak chen bann mouton yo.<verse eid="JOB 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 30:2" />Anverite, ki byen fòs men pa yo ta kab fè m?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:2">Gwo fòs te deja disparèt nan yo<verse eid="JOB 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 30:3" />akoz mank bagay ak grangou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:3">Y ap manje tè sèk nan lannwit lan, ak pèt e ak dezolasyon an.<verse eid="JOB 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 30:4" />Yo rache fèy raje nan mitan rakèt la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:4">Manje yo se rasin bayawonn.<verse eid="JOB 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 30:5" />Yo chase yo deyò lavil la nan dezè;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:5">yo kriye dèyè yo tankou se vòlè,<verse eid="JOB 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 30:6" />jiskaske yo vin rete nan move ravin yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:6">nan twou tè ak nan wòch yo.<verse eid="JOB 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 30:7" />Pami rak tibwa yo, yo rele fò.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:7">Anba machacha a, yo vin rasanble ansanm.<verse eid="JOB 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 30:8" />Pitit a moun fou, wi, pitit a mechan yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:8">yo te resevwa fwèt jis lè yo kite peyi a.<verse eid="JOB 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 30:9" />Men koulye a, se mwen menm yo pase nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:4">Job 12:4</ref></char></note>rizib;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:9">mwen devni yon pawòl betiz pou yo.<verse eid="JOB 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 30:10" />Yo pè m, yo kanpe lwen m,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:10">e yo pa sispann <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 50:6">És 50:6</ref></char></note>krache nan figi m.<verse eid="JOB 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 30:11" />Akoz Li te lage fisèl banza a pou te aflije mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:11">yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 32:9">Sòm 32:9</ref></char></note>rete retire brid la nèt devan m.<verse eid="JOB 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 30:12" />Sou men dwat lan, nich sa vin leve.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:12">Yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 140:4-5">Sòm 140:4-5</ref></char></note>rale pye mwen akote.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:12">Yo mennen kont mwen tout manèv destriksyon yo.<verse eid="JOB 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 30:13" />Yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 3:12">És 3:12</ref></char></note>gate wout mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:13">Yo bourade lachit mwen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:13">san mande sekou.<verse eid="JOB 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 30:14" />Tankou nan yon gran brèch, yo parèt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:14">nan mitan tanpèt, yo woule m.<verse eid="JOB 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 30:15" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 3:25">Job 3:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gwo perèz yo vin vire kont mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:15">Yo tanmen gate respè m tankou van.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:15">Byennèt mwen disparèt tankou nwaj.<verse eid="JOB 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 30:16" />Konsa, koulye a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 42:4">Sòm 42:4</ref></char></note>nanm mwen vide nèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:16">Jou afliksyon yo sezi m.<verse eid="JOB 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 30:17" />Nan lannwit, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 30:30">Job 30:30</ref></char></note>zo m yo frennen anndan m,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:17">e sa yo kap manje m pa pran repo.<verse eid="JOB 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 30:18" />Ak gwo fòs, vètman m vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 2:7">Job 2:7</ref></char></note>tòde sou mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:18">Li mare m nèt tankou kolye manto m.<verse eid="JOB 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 30:19" />Li te jete mwen nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:2-14">Sòm 69:2-14</ref></char></note>labou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:19">e mwen te vin tankou pousyè ak sann.<verse eid="JOB 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 30:20" />Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 19:7">Job 19:7</ref></char></note>kriye a Ou menm pou sekou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:20">men Ou pa reponn mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:20">Mwen kanpe, e se gete, Ou gete m.<verse eid="JOB 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 30:21" />Ou vin okipe m ak mechanste.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:21">Avèk fòs a men Ou, Ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 16:9-14">Job 16:9-14</ref></char></note>pèsekite m.<verse eid="JOB 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 30:22" />Ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:17">Job 9:17</ref></char></note>leve m wo sou van, e fè m monte;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:22">epi Ou fè m fonn nèt nan move tan an.<verse eid="JOB 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 30:23" />Paske mwen konnen ke Ou ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:22">Job 9:22</ref></char></note>mennen m a lanmò,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:23">jis rive nan gwo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 12:5">Ekl 12:5</ref></char></note>kay asanble a ki fèt pou tout sila ki viv yo.<verse eid="JOB 30:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 30:24" />Malgre, èske yon moun k ap tonbe pa lonje men l?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:24">Oswa nan gwo pwoblem li pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 19:7">Job 19:7</ref></char></note>kriye sekou?<verse eid="JOB 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 30:25" />Èske mwen pa t kriye pou sila nan gwo twoub?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:25">Èske nanm mwen pa t plen tristès pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 24:4">Job 24:4</ref></char></note>malere a?<verse eid="JOB 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 30:26" />Lè m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:25-26">Job 3:25-26</ref></char></note>t ap tann sa ki bon an, se mal ki rive m;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:26">lè m tap tann limyè, alò se tenèb ki te vini.<verse eid="JOB 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 30:27" />Kè m twouble nèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 2:11">Lam 2:11</ref></char></note>anndan m.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:27">Mwen pa kab poze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:27">Jou plen ak afliksyon yo parèt devan m.<verse eid="JOB 30:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 30:28" />Mwen fè dèy toupatou san solèy.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:28">Mwen kanpe nan asanble;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:28">mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 19:7">Job 19:7</ref></char></note>rele sekou.<verse eid="JOB 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 30:29" />Mwen te vin frè ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 44:19">Sòm 44:19</ref></char></note>chen mawon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:29">zanmi ak otrich la.<verse eid="JOB 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 30:30" />Chè m vin nwa sou mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:30">li kale, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 102:3">Sòm 102:3</ref> </char></note>zo m yo brile ak lafyèv.<verse eid="JOB 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 30:31" />Pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 24:8">És 24:8</ref></char></note> se doulè ap mwen jwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:31">e flit mwen an sonne pou sila k ap kriye.<verse eid="JOB 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JOB 31" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 31:1" />“Mwen te fè yon akò ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:28">Mat 5:28</ref></char></note>zye m;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:1">alò kòman konsa mwen ta kab voye rega mwen sou yon vyèj?<verse eid="JOB 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 31:2" />Paske se kisa ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 20:29">Job 20:29</ref></char></note>pòsyon Bondye soti anwo a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:2">ak eritaj a Toupwisan an soti anwo a?<verse eid="JOB 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 31:3" />Èske li pa yon malè pou sila ki pa dwat yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:3">ak yon dezas pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 34:22">Job 34:22</ref></char></note>sila ki fè inikite yo?<verse eid="JOB 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 31:4" />Èske Li pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 16:9">II Kwo 16:9</ref></char></note>wè chemen mwen yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:4">e kontwole tout pa mwen yo?<verse eid="JOB 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 31:5" />“Si mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 15:31">Job 15:31</ref></char></note>mache nan sa ki fo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:5">e pye m te kouri dèyè twonpe moun,<verse eid="JOB 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 31:6" />(kite Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 6:2-3">Job 6:2-3</ref></char></note>peze mwen nan yon balans ki jis</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:6">e kite Bondye konnen entegrite m).<verse eid="JOB 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 31:7" />Si pa m yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 23:11">Job 23:11</ref></char></note>vire kite chemen an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:7">oswa kè m te swiv zye m,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:7">oswa si gen yon tach ki kole sou men m,<verse eid="JOB 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 31:8" />kite mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:16">Lev 26:16</ref></char></note>simen pou yon lòt ta manje,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:8">e kite tout sa m plante vin rache.<verse eid="JOB 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 31:9" />“Si kè m te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 24:15">Job 24:15</ref></char></note>sedwi pa yon fanm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:9">oswa mwen te mize nan pòtay vwazen mwen,<verse eid="JOB 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 31:10" />kite madanm mwen graje pou yon lòt</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:10">e kite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:30">Det 28:30</ref></char></note>lòt yo vin kouche sou li.<verse eid="JOB 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 31:11" />Paske sa ta yon krim <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:10">Lev 20:10</ref></char></note>sansyèl;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:11">anplis, li ta yon inikite ki ta dwe jije.<verse eid="JOB 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 31:12" />Paske li ta yon dife ki pou limen jis rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 26:6">Job 26:6</ref> </char></note>Sejou Lanmò yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:12">e ta derasine tout byen mwen ranmase yo.<verse eid="JOB 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 31:13" />Si mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:14-15">Det 24:14-15</ref></char></note>refize demand esklav mwen an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:13">gason kon fanm, lè l te fè yon plent kont mwen,<verse eid="JOB 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 31:14" />alò, kisa mwen ta kab fè lè Bondye leve?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:14">Konsa, lè L rele m pou jijman,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:14">ki repons mwen ta kab bay Li?<verse eid="JOB 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 31:15" />Èske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 10:3">Job 10:3</ref></char></note>Sila ki te fè m nan vant lan pa t fè li menm tou?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:15">Se pa Li sèl ki te fòme nou nan vant lan?<verse eid="JOB 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 31:16" />Si mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:16">Job 5:16</ref></char></note>anpeche malere yo nan dezi yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:16">oswa te fè zye a vèv la pa wè klè,<verse eid="JOB 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 31:17" />oswa te manje pòsyon pa mwen pou kont mwen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:17">san <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 29:12">Job 29:12</ref> </char></note>òfelen an pa jwen ladann,<verse eid="JOB 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 31:18" />(Men depi jenès mwen, òfelen an te grandi avè m tankou papa l</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:18">e soti nan anfans lan, mwen te fè gid pou vèv la),<verse eid="JOB 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 31:19" />si mwen te wè yon moun peri akoz mank rad,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:19">oswa ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 24:4">Job 24:4</ref></char></note>sila ak bezwen pa t gen anyen pou kouvri l,<verse eid="JOB 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 31:20" />si kè li pa t beni m,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:20">si li pa t chofe ak lenn mouton mwen an,<verse eid="JOB 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 31:21" />si mwen te leve men m kont <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 29:12">Job 29:12</ref></char></note>òfelen an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:21">akoz mwen te wè soutyen mwen nan pòtay la,<verse eid="JOB 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 31:22" />alò, kite zepòl mwen tonbe sòti nan zepòl li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:22">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 38:15">Job 38:15</ref></char></note>bra m kase soti nan zo li.<verse eid="JOB 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 31:23" />Paske m pè anpil malè Bondye a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:23">Li tèlman gran ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 13:11">Job 13:11</ref></char></note>majeste,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:23">m pa ka fè anyen devan L.<verse eid="JOB 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 31:24" />Si se nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:24">Job 22:24</ref></char></note>lò mwen te mete espwa m,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:24">pou m te di lò fen a, ‘se ou ki konfyans mwen,’<verse eid="JOB 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 31:25" />Si mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:3-10">Job 1:3-10</ref></char></note>rejwi akoz byen mwen yo te tèlman gran,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:25">e akoz men m te tèlman ranmase anpil;<verse eid="JOB 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 31:26" />si mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:19">Det 4:19</ref></char></note>gade solèy la lè l t ap brile,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:26">oswa lalin nan lè li prale nan bèlte li,<verse eid="JOB 31:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 31:27" />epi kè m te vin sedwi an sekrè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:27">e men mwen te voye yon bo ki sòti nan bouch mwen,<verse eid="JOB 31:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 31:28" />sa osi ta yon inikite ki merite jijman,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:28">paske mwen t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:27">Jos 24:27</ref></char></note>abandone Bondye anwo a.<verse eid="JOB 31:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 31:29" />Èske mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 17:5">Pwov 17:5</ref></char></note>rejwi lè lènmi m te vin disparèt nèt?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:29">Oswa bat men m lè mal vin rive li?<verse eid="JOB 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 31:30" />Non, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 7:4">Sòm 7:4</ref></char></note>mwen pa t kite bouch mwen peche,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:30">ni mwen pa t mande pou l ta mouri avèk malediksyon.<verse eid="JOB 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 31:31" />Èske mesye nan tant mwen yo pa t di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:31">‘Ou pa p twouve yon moun ki pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:7">Job 22:7</ref></char></note>satisfè ak vyann pa li a?’<verse eid="JOB 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 31:32" />Etranje a pa t rete deyò;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:32">mwen te ouvri pòt mwen yo a vwayajè a.<verse eid="JOB 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 31:33" />Èske m te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:10">Jen 3:10</ref></char></note>kouvri transgresyon mwen yo tankou Adam?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:33">Oswa kache inikite mwen nan kè mwen,<verse eid="JOB 31:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 31:34" />akoz mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:2">Egz 23:2</ref></char></note>krent gwo foul la?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:34">Oswa akoz krent gwo wont lan devan lòt fanmi yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:34">te kenbe silans mwen e pa t sòti deyò?<verse eid="JOB 31:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 31:35" />O ke m te gen yon moun ki pou tande mwen!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:35">Gade byen, men otograf mwen! Kite Toupwisan an reponn mwen!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:35">Mennen pwosè vèbal ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 27:7">Job 27:7</ref></char></note>akizè a te ekri.<verse eid="JOB 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 31:36" />Anverite, mwen ta pote l sou zepòl mwen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:36">mwen ta mare l sou mwen tankou yon kouwòn.<verse eid="JOB 31:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 31:37" />Mwen ta deklare a Li fòs kantite pa pye mwen yo pran.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:37">Tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:3">Job 1:3</ref></char></note>yon prens mwen ta parèt devan L.<verse eid="JOB 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 31:38" />Si menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 24:2">Job 24:2</ref></char></note>teren mwen an rele kont mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:38">e tout tranch li yo kriye ansanm;<verse eid="JOB 31:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 31:39" />si mwen te manje fwi li san lajan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:39">oswa te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:19">I Wa 21:19</ref></char></note>kòz ke mèt li yo te pèdi lavi yo,<verse eid="JOB 31:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 31:40" />kite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 32:13">Job 32:13</ref></char></note>pikan yo grandi olye ble</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:40">e zèb santi fò ranplase lòj la.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JOB 31:40" />
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 31:40">Pawòl yo a Job se fini.<verse eid="JOB 31:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JOB 32" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 32:1" />Konsa, twa mesye sila yo te sispann reponn Job, akoz li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 10:7">Job 10:7</ref></char></note>dwat nan pwòp zye pa li. <verse eid="JOB 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 32:2" />Men kòlè a Élihu, fis a Barakeel la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:21">Jen 22:21</ref></char></note>Bizit nan fanmi a Ram nan, te brile kont Job. Kòlè li te brile paske li te jistifye pwòp tèt li devan Bondye. <verse eid="JOB 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 32:3" />Epi kòlè li te brile kont twa zanmi li yo akoz yo pa t jwenn bon repons, men karema, yo te kondane Job. <verse eid="JOB 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 32:4" />Alò, Élihu te tann yo fini pou pale ak Job, akoz yo menm te gen anpil ane pi gran pase li. <verse eid="JOB 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 32:5" />Konsa, lè Élihu te wè ke pa t gen repons ki rete nan bouch a twa mesye yo, kòlè li te brile.<verse eid="JOB 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 32:6" />Pou sa, Élihu, fis a Barakeel la, Bizit la, te pale klè. Li te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:6">“Mwen jèn selon ane yo, e nou menm, nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 15:10">Job 15:10</ref></char></note>granmoun.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:6">Akoz sa a, mwen te krent pou di nou sa ke m t ap panse a.<verse eid="JOB 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 32:7" />Mwen te reflechi ke se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 8:8-9">Job 8:8-9</ref></char></note>laj ki te dwe pale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:7">ke anpil ane yo ta dwe bay sajès.<verse eid="JOB 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 32:8" />Men se yon lespri ki nan lòm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:8">e se souf a Toupwisan an ki bay yo bon<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 38:36">Job 38:36</ref></char></note>konprann.<verse eid="JOB 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 32:9" />Anpil ane pa vle di saj,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:9">ni pa fwa, se pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 32:7">Job 32:7</ref></char></note>granmoun ki konprann sa ki dwat.<verse eid="JOB 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 32:10" />Pou sa, mwen di nou ‘koute mwen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:10">mwen menm tou va di nou sa ke m panse.’<verse eid="JOB 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 32:11" />“Gade byen, mwen te tann pawòl nou yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:11">Mwen te koute byen rezonman pa nou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:11">pandan nou t ap reflechi sou sa pou nou ta di.<verse eid="JOB 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 32:12" />Menm mwen te swiv nou byen pre;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:12">anverite, pa t gen pèsòn ki te vin genyen Job.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:12">Nanpwen moun ki te byen reponn pawòl li yo.<verse eid="JOB 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 32:13" />Pran atansyon nou pa di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:23">Jr 9:23</ref></char></note>‘Nou jwenn sajès.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:13">Se Bondye ki pou korije l, se pa lòm.’<verse eid="JOB 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 32:14" />Paske pawòl li yo pa t pale kont mwen menm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:14">ni mwen p ap reponn li ak diskou pa nou yo.<verse eid="JOB 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 32:15" />“Yo etonnen nèt; yo pa reponn ankò.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:15">Yo pa gen mo ki pou di.<verse eid="JOB 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 32:16" />Èske se tann, pou m ta tann akoz yo pa pale?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:16">Akoz yo rete e pa reponn ankò?<verse eid="JOB 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 32:17" />Mwen menm tou va reponn pou kont mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:17">mwen osi va bay pozisyon pa m.<verse eid="JOB 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 32:18" />Paske mwen chaje ak pawòl.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:18">Lespri m anndan mwen bourade m.<verse eid="JOB 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 32:19" />Men gade, lestonmak mwen tankou diven san mwayen respire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:19">tankou po diven nèf, li prèt menm pou pete.<verse eid="JOB 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 32:20" />Kite mwen pale pou m kab jwenn soulajman;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:20">kite mwen ouvri lèv mwen pou bay repons.<verse eid="JOB 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 32:21" />Alò, pa kite mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:15">Lev 19:15</ref></char></note>pran pati a okenn moun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:21">ni flate pèsòn.<verse eid="JOB 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 32:22" />Paske mwen pa konn flate moun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:22">sof Sila ki kreye mwen an, ta vin ranmase m fè m ale.”<verse eid="JOB 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JOB 33" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 33:1" />“Malgre sa, koulye a, Job, souple <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 13:6">Job 13:6</ref></char></note>tande mesaj mwen an</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:1">e koute tout pawòl mwen yo.<verse eid="JOB 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 33:2" />Gade byen, se koulye a mwen ouvri bouch mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:2">Se lang nan bouch mwen ki pale.<verse eid="JOB 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 33:3" />Pawòl mwen yo sòti nan ladwati kè mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:3">e lèv mwen pale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 6:28">Job 6:28</ref></char></note>soti yon kè ki renmen verite a.<verse eid="JOB 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 33:4" />Se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Jen 2:7</ref></char></note>Lespri Bondye ki te fè m,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:4">e souf Toupwisan an ki ban m lavi.<verse eid="JOB 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 33:5" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 33:32">Job 33:32</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Di m se pa sa, si ou kapab.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:5">Alinye pawòl ou yo an lòd devan m, e kanpe.<verse eid="JOB 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 33:6" />Men gade byen, mwen se moun Bondye menm jan tankou ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:6">Mwen menm tou te fèt ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:19">Job 4:19</ref></char></note>ajil la.<verse eid="JOB 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 33:7" />Gade byen, se pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 13:21">Job 13:21</ref></char></note>okenn krent mwen gen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:7">ki ta bay ou laperèz,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:7">ni se pa akoz fòs pwa balans mwen an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:7">ke ou ta twouve chaj la lou.<verse eid="JOB 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 33:8" />“Anverite, ou te pale kote pou m ta tande,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:8">e mwen te tande son a pawòl ou yo.<verse eid="JOB 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 33:9" />Job te di: ‘Mwen san tach, san transgresyon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:9">mwen inosan e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 10:14">Job 10:14</ref></char></note>nanpwen koupabilite nan mwen.<verse eid="JOB 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 33:10" />Gade byen, Li envante pretèks kont mwen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:10">Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 13:24">Job 13:24</ref></char></note>kontwole m tankou lènmi.<verse eid="JOB 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 33:11" />Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 13:27">Job 13:27</ref></char></note>mete pye mwen nan sèp;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:11">Li veye tout chemen mwen yo.’<verse eid="JOB 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 33:12" />“Gade byen Job, kite mwen di ou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 7:20">Ekl 7:20</ref></char></note>ou pa gen rezon nan sa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:12">paske Bondye pi gran ke lòm.<verse eid="JOB 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 33:13" />Poukisa ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 40:2">Job 40:2</ref></char></note>plenyen kont Li</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:13">ke Li pa eksplike ou tout zak Li yo?<verse eid="JOB 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 33:14" />Anverite, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 33:29">Job 33:29</ref></char></note>Bondye pale yon fwa, oswa de fwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:14">men pèsòn pa okipe sa.<verse eid="JOB 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 33:15" />Nan yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:12-17">Job 4:12-17</ref></char></note>rèv, yon vizyon nan nwit la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:15">lè dòmi pwofon kon tonbe sou lòm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:15">pandan yo nan somèy sou kabann yo,<verse eid="JOB 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 33:16" />konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 36:10-15">Job 36:10-15</ref></char></note>Li ouvri zòrèy a lòm</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:16">e mete so sou enstriksyon yo,<verse eid="JOB 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 33:17" />pou Li kapab vire lòm pou chanje kondwit li</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:17">e anpeche li fè ògèy.<verse eid="JOB 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 33:18" />Konsa, Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 33:22-30">Job 33:22-30</ref></char></note>pwoteje nanm li pou l pa rive nan fòs la</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:18">e lavi li pou l pa lantre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 15:22">Job 15:22</ref></char></note>nan Sejou Lanmò a.<verse eid="JOB 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 33:19" />“Lòm, anplis, resevwa chatiman <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 30:17">Job 30:17</ref></char></note>doulè sou kabann li;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:19">avèk plent san rete jis rive nan zo li;<verse eid="JOB 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 33:20" />jiskaske lavi li vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:24">Job 3:24</ref></char></note>rayi pen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:20">e nanm li, manje ke li te pi renmen an.<verse eid="JOB 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 33:21" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 16:8">Job 16:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Chè li epwize vin disparèt pou moun pa wè l</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:21">e zo li yo ki pa te konn vizib pouse vin parèt.<verse eid="JOB 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 33:22" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 33:18-28">Job 33:18-28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nanm li vin rale toupre fòs lanmò a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:22">e lavi li pwoche sila kap detwi yo.<verse eid="JOB 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 33:23" />“Si gen yon zanj pou ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 40:8">Jen 40:8</ref></char></note>entèsede pou li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:23">se tankou youn nan yon milye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:23">ki pou ta fè yon moun sonje sa k ap bon pou li,<verse eid="JOB 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 33:24" />konsa, Bondye fè l gras. Li di l:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:24">‘Delivre li pou l pa rive nan fòs lanmò a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:24">Mwen te twouve yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 36:18">Job 36:18</ref></char></note>racha.’<verse eid="JOB 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 33:25" />Kite chè li vin pi fre ke li te ye nan jenès li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:25">Kite li retoune nan jou a fòs jenès li yo.<verse eid="JOB 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 33:26" />Konsa, li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:27">Job 22:27</ref></char></note>priye a Bondye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:26">e Li va aksepte li, pou l kab wè figi L plèn ak jwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:26">Se konsa, Li restore ladwati a lòm.<verse eid="JOB 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 33:27" />Li va chante devan lèzòm. Li va di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:27">“Mwen te peche, mwen te konwonpi sa ki dwat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:27">e li pa t bon pou mwen.<verse eid="JOB 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 33:28" />Li te rachte nanm mwen pou l pa rive nan fòs lanmò a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:28">e lavi m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:28">Job 22:28</ref></char></note>va wè limyè a.’<verse eid="JOB 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 33:29" />“Gade byen, Bondye konn fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:11">Ef 1:11</ref></char></note>tout bagay</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:29">sa yo de fwa, menm twa fwa ak yon nonm,<verse eid="JOB 33:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 33:30" />pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 33:18">Job 33:18</ref></char></note>mennen nanm li fè l sòti kite fòs lanmò a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:30">pou l kab eklèsi ak limyè lavi a.<verse eid="JOB 33:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 33:31" />Prete atansyon, O Job, koute m byen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:31">rete an silans e kite mwen pale.<verse eid="JOB 33:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 33:32" />Si ou gen yon bagay pou di, alò, reponn mwen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:32">pale, paske mwen vle ba ou rezon.<verse eid="JOB 33:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 33:33" />Men si non, koute mwen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:33">rete an silans, e mwen va montre ou sajès.”<verse eid="JOB 33:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JOB 34" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 34:1" />Alò, Élihu te kontinye. Li te di:<verse eid="JOB 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 34:2" />“Koute pawòl mwen yo, sila ki saj pami nou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:2">Koute mwen, nou menm ki gen konesans.<verse eid="JOB 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 34:3" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:11">Job 12:11</ref></char></note>zòrèy la fè prèv pawòl yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:3">jan bouch la goute manje a.<verse eid="JOB 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 34:4" />Kite nou chwazi pou nou menm sa ki dwat;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:4">kite nou konnen pami nou menm sa ki bon.<verse eid="JOB 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 34:5" />Paske Job te di: ‘Mwen dwat, men</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:5">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 27:2">Job 27:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Bondye te rache dwa mwen an;<verse eid="JOB 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 34:6" />èske mwen ta dwe manti selon dwa m?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:6">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 6:4">Job 6:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Blese m se san gerizon, san ke m pa fè transgresyon.’<verse eid="JOB 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 34:7" />Se kilès ki tankou Job,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:7">k ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 15:16">Job 15:16</ref></char></note>bwè giyonnen moun tankou se dlo,<verse eid="JOB 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 34:8" />ki ale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:15">Job 22:15</ref></char></note>kenbe konpanyen ak sila ki fè inikite yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:8">e mache avèk moun malveyan yo?<verse eid="JOB 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 34:9" />Paske li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 21:5">Job 21:5</ref></char></note>‘Sa pa fè okenn avantaj pou moun</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:9">lè l pran plezi li nan Bondye.’<verse eid="JOB 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 34:10" />“Pou sa, koute mwen, nou menm ki gen bon konprann.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:10">Fòk se lwen pou Bondye ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 8:3">Job 8:3</ref></char></note>fè mechanste,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:10">e pou Toupwisan an fè mal.<verse eid="JOB 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 34:11" />Paske Li rekonpanse lòm selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:10">II Kor 5:10</ref></char></note>zèv li yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:11">e fè li jwenn selon chemen li.<verse eid="JOB 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 34:12" />Anverite, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 34:10">Job 34:10</ref></char></note>Bondye p ap aji avèk mechanste,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:12">ni Toupwisan an p ap fè jistis vin konwonpi.<verse eid="JOB 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 34:13" />Se kilès ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 38:4">Job 38:4</ref></char></note>bay Li otorite sou latè?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:13">Epi se kilès ki te poze responsabilite tout mond lan sou Li?<verse eid="JOB 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 34:14" />Si Li ta pran desizyon pou Li fè; si Li ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:29">Sòm 104:29</ref></char></note>ranmase tout a Li menm</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:14">pwòp lespri Li a, menm ak souf Li a,<verse eid="JOB 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 34:15" />Tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:21">Jen 7:21</ref></char></note>chè ta peri ansanm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:15">e lòm ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 10:9">Job 10:9</ref> </char></note>retounen nan pousyè.<verse eid="JOB 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 34:16" />“Men si gen moun bon konprann, koute sa a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:16">koute vwa pawòl mwen yo.<verse eid="JOB 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 34:17" />Èske menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 23:3">II Sam 23:3</ref></char></note>yon moun ki rayi jistis ta dwe renye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:17">Èske ou va kondane Sila ki dwat e pwisan an,<verse eid="JOB 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 34:18" />ka p di a yon wa: ‘Sanzave’,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:18">a prens yo: ‘Nou mechan’;<verse eid="JOB 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 34:19" />Ki p ap montre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:17">I Pi 1:17</ref></char></note>patipri a prens yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:19">ni rich yo kon pi enpòtan ke pòv,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:19">paske tout moun se zèv a men Li ke yo ye.<verse eid="JOB 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 34:20" />Nan yon moman, yo mouri;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:20">epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:29">Egz 12:29</ref></char></note>nan mitan lannwit, yon pèp vin etone.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:20">Pwisan yo disparèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:20">Yo retire san yon men leve.<verse eid="JOB 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 34:21" />“Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 15:3">Pwov 15:3</ref></char></note>zye Li sou chemen a yon nonm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:21">Li wè tout pa li fè.<verse eid="JOB 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 34:22" />Nanpwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 139:11-12">Sòm 139:11-12</ref></char></note>fènwa, ni lonbraj fonse</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:22">kote malfektè inikite yo kab kache kò yo.<verse eid="JOB 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 34:23" />Paske Li pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 11:11">Job 11:11</ref></char></note>bezwen obsève yon nonm anpil</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:23">pou li ta dwe pase an jijman devan Bondye.<verse eid="JOB 34:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 34:24" />Li kraze <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:19">Job 12:19</ref></char></note>moun pwisan an an mòso, jan nou pa menm konprann,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:24">e mete lòt moun nan plas yo.<verse eid="JOB 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 34:25" />Se konsa, Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 34:11">Job 34:11</ref></char></note>konnen zèv yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:25">Li boulvèse yo nan lannwit, e yo kraze nèt.<verse eid="JOB 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 34:26" />Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 9:5">Sòm 9:5</ref></char></note>frape yo tankou mechan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:26">nan yon kote pou tout moun wè,<verse eid="JOB 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 34:27" />Akoz yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:11">I Sam 15:11</ref></char></note>vire akote nan swiv Li, e pat okipe chemen Li yo;<verse eid="JOB 34:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 34:28" />akoz yo te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 35:9">Job 35:9</ref></char></note>kri a malere a rive kote Li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:28">Li te tande kri a aflije yo.<verse eid="JOB 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 34:29" />Lè L rete an silans, se kilès ki kab kondane L?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:29">Epi lè L kache figi Li, alò, se kilès ki kab wè L?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:29">Li pli wo ke nasyon, ni lòm,<verse eid="JOB 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 34:30" />pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:15">Job 5:15</ref></char></note> anpeche moun ki san Bondye yo vin</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:30">reye, ke pa vin gen yon pèlen pou pèp yo.<verse eid="JOB 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 34:31" />“Paske èske nenpòt kon di Bondye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:31">‘Mwen koupab, mwen p ap fè ofans ankò;<verse eid="JOB 34:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 34:32" />enstwi mwen sa ke m pa wè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:32">Si mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 33:27">Job 33:27</ref></char></note>fè inikite, mwen p ap fè l ankò’?<verse eid="JOB 34:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 34:33" />Èske Li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 41:11">Job 41:11</ref></char></note>rekonpanse ak plan pa ou a, pou ou ka refize li?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:33">Paske se ou menm ki oblije chwazi; se pa mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:33">Pou sa a, deklare sa ke ou konnen.<verse eid="JOB 34:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 34:34" />Moun ak bon konprann va di mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:34">oswa yon nonm saj ki tande m va di:<verse eid="JOB 34:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 34:35" />‘Job <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 35:16">Job 35:16</ref></char></note>pale san konesans;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:35">pawòl li yo san sajès.<verse eid="JOB 34:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 34:36" />Mwen ta pito yo fè pwosè kont Job,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:36">jis rive nan tout limit li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:36">akoz li reponn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:15">Job 22:15</ref></char></note>tankou moun mechan yo.<verse eid="JOB 34:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 34:37" />Paske li ogmante <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 23:2">Job 23:2</ref></char></note>rebelyon sou tout lòt peche l yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:37">Li bat men li pami nou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:37">e ogmante pawòl li yo kont Bondye.’”<verse eid="JOB 34:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JOB 35" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 35:1" />Konsa, Élihu te kontinye. Li te di:<verse eid="JOB 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 35:2" />“Èske ou sipoze ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 27:2">Job 27:2</ref></char></note>ou ge dwa sa a?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:2">Èske ou ap di ‘Ladwati pa m nan depase sa k nan Bondye a?’<verse eid="JOB 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 35:3" />Paske ou mande: ‘Ki avantaj sa ye pou ou?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:3">Ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:30-31">Job 9:30-31</ref></char></note>pwofi m ap jwenn ki plis pase si m te fè peche?’<verse eid="JOB 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 35:4" />Mwen va reponn ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:4">menm ak zanmi ou yo tou.<verse eid="JOB 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 35:5" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 15:5">Jen 15:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gade nan syèl yo pou wè;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:5">epi gade byen nan nwaj yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:5">Yo pi wo pase ou.<verse eid="JOB 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 35:6" />Si ou te peche, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 8:36">Pwov 8:36</ref></char></note>kisa ou akonpli kont Li?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:6">Epi si transgresyon ou yo anpil, kisa ou fè Li?<verse eid="JOB 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 35:7" />Si ou jis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:10">Luc 17:10</ref></char></note>kisa ou ba Li, oswa kisa Li ta jwenn nan men ou?<verse eid="JOB 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 35:8" />Mechanste ou ka donmaje yon nonm tankou ou menm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:8">e ladwati ou gen benefis pou yon fis a lòm.<verse eid="JOB 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 35:9" />“Akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:23">Egz 2:23</ref></char></note>fòs kantite opresyon yo, yo kriye fò.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:9">Yo kriye pou sekou akoz bra a pwisan an.<verse eid="JOB 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 35:10" />Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 21:14">Job 21:14</ref></char></note>pèsòn pa di: ‘Kote Bondye, Kreyatè mwen an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:10">ki bay chan kè kontan yo pandan nwit lan,<verse eid="JOB 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 35:11" />ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 94:12">Sòm 94:12</ref></char></note>enstwi nou plis pase bèt latè yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:11">pou fè nou vin pi saj pase zwazo nan syèl yo?’<verse eid="JOB 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 35:12" />La, yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 1:28">Pwov 1:28</ref></char></note>kriye fò, men nanpwen repons</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:12">akoz ògèy moun mechan yo.<verse eid="JOB 35:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 35:13" />Anverite, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 11:11">Jr 11:11</ref></char></note>Bondye p ap koute yon kri ki vid,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:13">ni Toupwisan an p ap okipe l.<verse eid="JOB 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 35:14" />Konbyen anmwens, lè ou di ou pa wè Li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:14">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 31:35">Job 31:35</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ka a pase devan L, e fòk se Li ou tann!<verse eid="JOB 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 35:15" />Men koulye a, akoz Li pa t fè vizit nan kòlè Li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:15">ni Li pa t apresye awogans,<verse eid="JOB 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 35:16" />pou sa, Job ouvri bouch li an ven;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:16">li ogmante pawòl li yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 34:35">Job 34:35</ref></char></note>san konesans.”<verse eid="JOB 35:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JOB 36" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 36:1" />Alò, Élihu te kontinye. Li te di:<verse eid="JOB 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 36:2" />Tann mwen yon ti kras, e mwen va montre ou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:2">jiska prezan, gen anpil bagay ankò pou di sou pati Bondye.<verse eid="JOB 36:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 36:3" />M ap prale chache lespri m soti byen lwen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:3">mwen va fè prèv <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 8:3">Job 8:3</ref></char></note>ladwati a Kreyatè mwen an.<verse eid="JOB 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 36:4" />Paske anverite, pawòl mwen yo pa fo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:4">Yon ki pafè nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 37:16">Job 37:16</ref></char></note>konesans se avèk ou.<verse eid="JOB 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 36:5" />Gade byen, Bondye pwisan, men li pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:24">Sòm 22:24</ref></char></note>meprize pèsòn;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:5">Li pwisan nan fòs konprann pa Li.<verse eid="JOB 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 36:6" />Li pa konsève lavi a mechan yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:6">men Li bay jistis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:15">Job 5:15</ref></char></note>aflije yo.<verse eid="JOB 36:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 36:7" />Li pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 33:18">Sòm 33:18</ref></char></note>retire zye Li sou moun ladwati yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:7">men avèk wa ki chita sou twòn yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:7">li bay yo chèz jis pou tout tan, e yo leve wo.<verse eid="JOB 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 36:8" />Si yo mare ak gwo fè, e mare nèt nan kòd <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 36:15-21">Job 36:15-21</ref></char></note>aflije yo,<verse eid="JOB 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 36:9" />konsa, Li fè yo konnen travay yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:9">ak transgresyon yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:9">ke yo te leve tèt yo wo ak orgèy.<verse eid="JOB 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 36:10" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 33:16">Job 33:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Li ouvri zòrèy yo pou yo ka instwi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:10">e pase lòd pou yo retounen, kite inikite a.<verse eid="JOB 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 36:11" />Si yo tande e sèvi Li, yo va fè dènye jou yo nan abondans,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:11">e ane pa yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:11">Sòm 16:11</ref> </char></note>ranpli ak rejwisans.<verse eid="JOB 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 36:12" />Men si yo pa tande, yo va peri pa nepe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:12">yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:21">Job 4:21</ref></char></note>mouri san konesans.<verse eid="JOB 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 36:13" />Men enkwayan yo ranmase lakòlè;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:13">yo refize kriye sekou lè L mare yo.<verse eid="JOB 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 36:14" />Yo mouri nan jenès yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:14">e lavi yo vin pèdi pami <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:17">Det 23:17</ref></char></note>pwostitiye tanp yo.<verse eid="JOB 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 36:15" />Li delivre aflije yo nan afliksyon yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:15">e ouvri zòrèy yo nan tan opresyon yo.<verse eid="JOB 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 36:16" />Wi, anverite Li t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:14">Os 2:14</ref></char></note> mennen ou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:16">lwen bouch gwo twoub la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:16">pou ou jwenn yon plas ki laj, e san limit.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:16">Konsa, sa ki plase sou tab ou, ta plen ak grès.<verse eid="JOB 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 36:17" />Men ou te ranpli ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:5-11">Job 22:5-11</ref></char></note>jijman sou mechan yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:17">se jijman ak jistis ki te posede ou.<verse eid="JOB 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 36:18" />Pa kite riches ou mennen ou nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 4:4-9">Jon 4:4-9</ref></char></note>lakòlè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:18">ni pa kite gwosè sa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 33:24">Job 33:24</ref></char></note>kap vèse sou tab</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:18">fè ou vire akote.<verse eid="JOB 36:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 36:19" />Èske richès ou yo ta fè ou envite gwo twoub la?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:19">Oswa èske tout fòs pwisans ou ta ka anpeche l rive?<verse eid="JOB 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 36:20" />Pa fè lanvi pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 34:20-25">Job 34:20-25</ref></char></note>lannwit,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:20">moman an ke moun koupe retire nèt sou plas yo.<verse eid="JOB 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 36:21" />Fè atansyon; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 36:10">Job 36:10</ref></char></note>pa vire kote mal la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:21">paske ou te chwazi sa a olye afliksyon an.<verse eid="JOB 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 36:22" />Gade byen, Bondye byen wo nan pouvwa Li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:22">Ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 35:11">Job 35:11</ref></char></note>pwofesè ki tankou Li?<verse eid="JOB 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 36:23" />Se kilès ki te dirije L pou pran chemen Li an?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:23">Epi kilès ki ka di L <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:4">Det 32:4</ref></char></note>‘Ou antò a?’<verse eid="JOB 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 36:24" />Sonje ke ou dwe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 92:5">Sòm 92:5</ref></char></note>leve zèv Li yo wo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:24">sa yo sou sila moun te konn chante yo.<verse eid="JOB 36:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 36:25" />Tout moun konn wè sa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:25">Lòm gade l soti lwen.<verse eid="JOB 36:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 36:26" />Gade byen, Bondye leve wo, men nou pa konnen Li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:26">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 1:12">Eb 1:12</ref> </char>
    </note>Fòs kantite ane Li yo pa kab dekouvri menm.<verse eid="JOB 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 36:27" />Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 147:8">Sòm 147:8</ref></char></note>Li rale fè monte gout dlo yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:27">Yo fòme fè lapli ki sòti nan vapè,<verse eid="JOB 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 36:28" />ke nwaj yo fè vide desann.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:28">Yo vin lage sou lòm an fòs kantite.<verse eid="JOB 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 36:29" />Èske pèsòn kab konprann jan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 37:11-16">Job 37:11-16</ref></char></note>nwaj yo vin gaye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:29">ak tonnè k ap gwonde anwo plafon tant Li an?<verse eid="JOB 36:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 36:30" />Gade byen, Li gaye limyè Li toupatou Li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:30">Li kouvri fon lanmè yo.<verse eid="JOB 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 36:31" />Paske se avèk sa a ke li jije pèp yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:31">Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:17">Trav 14:17</ref> </char></note>bay yo manje an gran kantite.<verse eid="JOB 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 36:32" />Li kouvri men Li ak eklè la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:32">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 37:11-15">Job 37:11-15</ref></char></note>pase lòd pou l frape sou mak la.<verse eid="JOB 36:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 36:33" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 37:2">Job 37:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Bri li deklare prezans Li;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:33">menm tout bèt yo konnen sa k ap vin rive a.<verse eid="JOB 36:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JOB 37" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 37:1" />“Pou sa, menm kè mwen konn tranble.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:1">Li vòltije kite plas li.<verse eid="JOB 37:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 37:2" />Koute, O koute byen bri vwa L,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:2">k ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 37:4-5">Job 37:4-5</ref></char></note>gwonde tankou tonnè</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:2">ak bri tonnè a k ap sòti nan bouch Li.<verse eid="JOB 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 37:3" />Anba tout syèl la, Li lage sa nèt ale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:3">ak loray Li jis rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 28:24">Job 28:24</ref></char></note>tout pwent tè a.<verse eid="JOB 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 37:4" />Apre sa, yon gwo vwa ki rele fò;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:4">Li gwonde ak vwa majeste Li a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:4">Li pa menm ralanti eklè lè yo tande vwa L.<verse eid="JOB 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 37:5" />Bondye gwonde avèk vwa mèvèy Li a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:5">L ap fè gwo bagay ke nou pa kab menm konprann.<verse eid="JOB 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 37:6" />Paske a lanèj la, Li di: ‘Tonbe sou latè’,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:6">e a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 36:27">Job 36:27</ref></char></note>inondasyon lapli a, Li di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:6">‘Kontinye tonbe fò’.<verse eid="JOB 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 37:7" />Li sele men a chak òm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:7">pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 111:2">Sòm 111:2</ref></char></note>tout moun kab konnen zèv Li yo.<verse eid="JOB 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 37:8" />Konsa, tout bèt sovaj va antre nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 38:40">Job 38:40</ref></char></note>kav yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:8">e rete lakay yo.<verse eid="JOB 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 37:9" />Men sòti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:9">Job 9:9</ref></char></note>sid, tanpèt la parèt</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:9">e nan nò, fredi a.<verse eid="JOB 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 37:10" />Soti nan souf Bondye, se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 38:29">Job 38:29</ref></char></note>glas ki fèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:10">e sifas dlo yo vin glasi.<verse eid="JOB 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 37:11" />Anplis, Li chaje vapè yo ak dlo e fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 37:15">Job 37:15</ref></char></note>nwaj la vin lou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:11">Li fè nwaj la gaye pou vide ekleraj Li.<verse eid="JOB 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 37:12" />Li chanje; Li gide l vire tounen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:12">pou l kab fè nenpòt sa Li kòmande l sou tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:21">És 14:21</ref></char></note>sifas tè a.<verse eid="JOB 37:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 37:13" />Se swa pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:18">Egz 9:18</ref></char></note>koreksyon, oswa pou mond Li an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:13">oswa pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:41-46">I Wa 18:41-46</ref></char></note>lanmou dous Li a, Li fè sa vin rive.<verse eid="JOB 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 37:14" />“Tande sa byen, O Job;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:14">Kanpe, e obsève mèvèy Bondye yo.<verse eid="JOB 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 37:15" />Èske ou konnen kijan Bondye etabli tout sila yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:15">e fè ekleraj nan nwaj Li yo vin limen?<verse eid="JOB 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 37:16" />Èske ou konnen bagay a chak kouch nan nwaj yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:16">mèvèy a Sila a ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 36:4">Job 36:4</ref></char></note>pafè nan konesans?<verse eid="JOB 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 37:17" />Poukisa vètman ou cho lè tè a kalm akoz van sid la?<verse eid="JOB 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 37:18" />Èske ou menm tou, ansanm avè L, ka ouvri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 10:12">Jr 10:12</ref></char></note> syèl yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:18">ki gen gran fòs tankou yon miwa metal ki fann nan dife?<verse eid="JOB 37:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 37:19" />Enstwi nou kisa pou nou ta pale Li;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:19">paske akoz fènwa a, nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:14">Job 9:14</ref></char></note>pa kab byen ranje ka nou.<verse eid="JOB 37:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 37:20" />Èske yo va di Li ke mwen ta renmen pale?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:20">Oswa èske yon nonm ta pito di ke li ta vle vin anglouti nèt?<verse eid="JOB 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 37:21" />“Alò lezòm pa wè limyè ki klere nan syèl yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:21">sof ke van an fin pase e eklèsi nwaj yo.<verse eid="JOB 37:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 37:22" />Sòti nan nò, se reyon majeste an lò;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:22">Bondye antoure ak majeste etonnan.<verse eid="JOB 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 37:23" />Toupwisan an,—nou pa kab jwenn Li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:23">Li egzalte nan pouvwa Li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:23">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 18:23-32">Éz 18:23-32</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jistis Li ak ladwati Li gran;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:23">Li pa janm oprime.<verse eid="JOB 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 37:24" />Se pou sa lezòm plen lakrent ak respe Li;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:24">Li pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:25">Mat 11:25</ref></char></note>konsidere okenn moun ki saj nan kè.”<verse eid="JOB 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JOB 38" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 38:1" />Konsa, Bondye te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 40:6">Job 40:6</ref></char></note>reponn Job nan van toubiyon an:<verse eid="JOB 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 38:2" />Se kilès sa a ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 35:16">Job 35:16</ref></char></note>twouble konsèy Mwen an</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:2">ak pawòl san konesans yo?<verse eid="JOB 38:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 38:3" />Alò, mare senti ou tankou gason,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:3">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 42:4">Job 42:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>M ap mande ou e ou va enstwi M!<verse eid="JOB 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 38:4" />“Kote ou te ye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:5">Sòm 104:5</ref></char></note>lè M te poze fondasyon mond lan?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:4">Pale si ou gen bon konprann,<verse eid="JOB 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 38:5" />Se kilès ki te etabli <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 8:29">Pwov 8:29</ref></char></note>mezi li? Konsi ou konnen?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:5">Oswa se kilès ki te lonje lign sou li?<verse eid="JOB 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 38:6" />Sou kilès <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 26:7">Job 26:7</ref></char></note>baz li yo te fonse?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:6">Oswa se kilès ki te poze ang prensipal li a,<verse eid="JOB 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 38:7" />lè zetwal maten yo te chante ansanm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:7">e tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:6">Job 1:6</ref></char></note>fis Bondye yo te rele fò ak gran jwa?<verse eid="JOB 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 38:8" />“Oswa se kilès ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:6-9">Sòm 104:6-9</ref></char></note>delimite lanmè a ak pòt yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:8">lè l te pete sòti nan vant lemonn nan;<verse eid="JOB 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 38:9" />lè M te fè yon nwaj sèvi vètman li</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:9">e fènwa byen pwès kon rad anfans li,<verse eid="JOB 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 38:10" />epi Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 8:29">Pwov 8:29</ref></char></note>plase lizyè sou li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:10">e te kadnase pòt li yo,<verse eid="JOB 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 38:11" />lè Mwen te di: ‘Men la, ou va rive e pa plis;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:11">men la vag ògèy ou va rete’?<verse eid="JOB 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 38:12" />“Èske pandan tout vi ou, ou te pase lòd pou maten rive,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:12">e fè solèy granmaten an konnen plas li,<verse eid="JOB 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 38:13" />pou l ta kenbe mechan yo sou pwent latè</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:13">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 34:25-26">Job 34:25-26</ref></char></note> souke l nèt pou yo sòti ladann?<verse eid="JOB 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 38:14" />Li vin chanje tankou ajil anba yon so;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:14">epi prezante la tankou yon abiman.<verse eid="JOB 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 38:15" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 5:14">Job 5:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sou mechan yo, limyè yo retire</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:15">e bwa souleve a vin kase.<verse eid="JOB 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 38:16" />“Èske ou konn antre nan sous lanmè yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:16">oswa mache nan fon pwofondè a?<verse eid="JOB 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 38:17" />Èske pòtay lanmò yo te konn vin vizib a ou menm?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:17">Oswa èske ou konn wè pòtay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 10:21">Job 10:21</ref></char></note>lonbraj lanmò yo?<verse eid="JOB 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 38:18" />Èske ou te konprann gwosè ak lajè tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 28:24">Job 28:24</ref></char></note>tè a?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:18">Di M si ou konnen tout sa a.<verse eid="JOB 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 38:19" />“Kote chemen an ye pou rive nan abitasyon limyè a?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:19">Epi tenèb la, kote landwa li,<verse eid="JOB 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 38:20" />pou ou ta mennen li nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 26:10">Job 26:10</ref></char></note>limit li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:20">pou ou ta kab konprann chemen pou rive lakay li?<verse eid="JOB 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 38:21" />Fòk ou konnen paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 15:7">Job 15:7</ref></char></note>ou te fèt avan sa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:21">e kantite jou ou yo vast!<verse eid="JOB 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 38:22" />Èske ou konn antre nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 37:6">Job 37:6</ref></char></note>kay depo nèj yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:22">oswa èske ou konn wè kay depo pou lagrèl yo,<verse eid="JOB 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 38:23" />ke M te rezève pou tan twoub la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:23">pou jou lagè ak batay la?<verse eid="JOB 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 38:24" />Kote chemen a ki pou fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 26:10">Job 26:10</ref></char></note>loray divize a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:24">oswa ki kote van lès la te gaye sou tè a?<verse eid="JOB 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 38:25" />“Se kilès ki te kreve yon kanal pou gran inondasyon an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:25">oswa yon chemen pou eklè ak tonnè a,<verse eid="JOB 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 38:26" />Pou mennen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 36:27">Job 36:27</ref></char></note>lapli nan yon teren kote nanpwen moun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:26">nan yon dezè san pèsòn ladann,<verse eid="JOB 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 38:27" />Pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:13-14">Sòm 104:13-14</ref></char></note>satisfè yon peyi savann dezole</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:27">e fè grenn zèb yo vin jèmen.<verse eid="JOB 38:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 38:28" />Èske lapli gen papa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:28">Oswa se kilès ki te reyisi fè gout lawouze yo?<verse eid="JOB 38:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 38:29" />Nan ki vant manman a sila <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 37:10">Job 37:10</ref></char></note>glas la te sòti?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:29">Epi fredi syèl la, se kilès ki te fè nesans li?<verse eid="JOB 38:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 38:30" />Dlo vin di tankou wòch</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:30">e sifas pwofondè a vin prizonye ladann.<verse eid="JOB 38:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 38:31" />“Èske ou konn mare chenn zetwal <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:9">Job 9:9</ref></char></note>Pleiades yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:31">oswa lage kòd zetwal Orion yo?<verse eid="JOB 38:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 38:32" />Èske ou kab mennen fè parèt tout sign Zodyak yo nan sezon yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:32">oswa gide zetwal Gran Lous la ak pitit li yo?<verse eid="JOB 38:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 38:33" />Èske ou konnen tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 148:6">Sòm 148:6</ref></char></note>règleman syèl la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:33">oswa èske ou kab etabli règleman pa yo sou tè a?<verse eid="JOB 38:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 38:34" />Èske ou kab leve vwa ou rive nan nwaj yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:34">pou fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:11">Job 22:11</ref></char></note>gwo kantite dlo vin kouvri ou?<verse eid="JOB 38:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 38:35" />Èske ou kab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 36:32">Job 36:32</ref></char></note>voye ekleraj yo pou yo rive di ou: ‘Men nou isit la’?<verse eid="JOB 38:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 38:36" />Se kilès ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 51:6">Sòm 51:6</ref></char></note>mete sajès nan kè lòm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:36">oswa te bay bon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 32:8">Job 32:8</ref></char></note>konprann nan panse a?<verse eid="JOB 38:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 38:37" />Se kilès ki kab konte nwaj yo ak sajès,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:37">oswa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 38:34">Job 38:34</ref></char></note>vide gwo krich dlo syèl yo,<verse eid="JOB 38:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 38:38" />Pou pousyè a vin di nan yon gwo ma dlo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:38">e bòl tè yo vin kole ansanm?<verse eid="JOB 38:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 38:39" />“Èske ou kab fè lachas pou bay lyon an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:21">Sòm 104:21</ref></char></note>manje,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:39">oswa satisfè apeti a jenn ti lyon yo,<verse eid="JOB 38:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 38:40" />Lè yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 37:8">Job 37:8</ref></char></note>kouche nan kav pa yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:40">e kouche tann pèlen bò lakay yo?<verse eid="JOB 38:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOB 38:41" />Se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 147:9">Sòm 147:9</ref></char></note>kilès ki prepare manje pou kòbo a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:41">lè pitit li rele kote Bondye e mache gaye grangou?<verse eid="JOB 38:41" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JOB 39" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 39:1" />“Èske ou konnen lè kabrit mòn yo fè pitit?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:1">Èske ou konn wè lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 29:9">Sòm 29:9</ref></char></note>sèf yo metba?<verse eid="JOB 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 39:2" />Èske ou kab kontwole mwa ke yo rete plenn yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:2">oswa èske ou konnen lè yo fè pitit?<verse eid="JOB 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 39:3" />Yo bese a jenou, yo pouse fè pitit yo parèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:3">yo fòse fè doulè yo fini nèt.<verse eid="JOB 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 39:4" />Pitit yo vin fò, yo grandi nan chan lib;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:4">yo ale e yo pa retounen kote yo.<verse eid="JOB 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 39:5" />“Se kilès ki te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 6:5">Job 6:5</ref></char></note>bourik mawon yo vin lib?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:5">Epi kilès ki te lache kòd ki te mare sou bourik kous la,<verse eid="JOB 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 39:6" />ke Mwen te bay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:24">Jr 2:24</ref></char></note>savann nan kon abitasyon li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:6">ak tè sale a kon kote pou l rete a?<verse eid="JOB 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 39:7" />Li pa bay valè a zen lavil la;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:7">kri a chofè yo, li pa okipe yo.<verse eid="JOB 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 39:8" />Li chache nan tout mòn yo pou manje l</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:8">e chache jwenn tout sa ki vèt.<verse eid="JOB 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 39:9" />“Èske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:21">Sòm 22:21</ref></char></note>bèf mawon va dakò pou sèvi ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:9">oswa èske l ap pase nwit lan devan manjwa ou?<verse eid="JOB 39:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 39:10" />Èske ou kab mare bèf mawon a ak kòd pou l</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:10">rete nan ranp li, oswa èske l ap boulvèse jaden an dèyè w?<verse eid="JOB 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 39:11" />Èske ou va fè l konfyans akoz gran fòs li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:11">e kite l responsab travay ou?<verse eid="JOB 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 39:12" />Èske ou va mete lafwa ou nan li pou li pote semans lakay,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:12">o ranmase seryel sou glasi vannen an?<verse eid="JOB 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 39:13" />“Zèl a otrich yo bat anlè ak gran jwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:13">men èske se plimaj lanmou?<verse eid="JOB 39:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 39:14" />Veye byen, li abandone pwòp ze li yo sou latè a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:14">pou yo ka chofe yo nan pousyè,<verse eid="JOB 39:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 39:15" />Li bliye yon grenn pye ka kraze yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:15">oswa yon bèt sovaj kab foule yo.<verse eid="JOB 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 39:16" />Li maltrete pitit li yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 4:3">Lam 4:3</ref></char></note>ak mechanste, konsi yo pa t pou li;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:16">menm si tout travay li ta an ven, sa pa regade l;<verse eid="JOB 39:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 39:17" />Akoz Bondye te fè li bliye sajès li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:17">e pa t bay li yon pòsyon bon konprann.<verse eid="JOB 39:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 39:18" />Lè l leve kò l anlè, li giyonnen cheval la ak chevalye a.<verse eid="JOB 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 39:19" />Èske se ou ki te bay cheval la fòs?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:19">Èske ou te abiye kou li ak krenyen?<verse eid="JOB 39:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 39:20" />Èske ou fè l vòltije tankou yon krikèt?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:20">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 8:16">Jr 8:16</ref> </char>
    </note>Gran souf ki sòti nan nen l byen etonnan.<verse eid="JOB 39:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 39:21" />Pye li fouye tè a nan vale a, e li kontan fòs li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:21">Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 8:6">Jr 8:6</ref></char></note>sòti parèt pou rankontre zam yo.<verse eid="JOB 39:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 39:22" />Li ri sou danje, ni li pa gen lakrent.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:22">Li pa vire fè bak devan nepe;<verse eid="JOB 39:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 39:23" />fouwo soukwe akote l,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:23">lans k ap briye a, ak gwo frenn nan.<verse eid="JOB 39:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 39:24" />Byen anraje e tranblan, li fè kous sou tè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:24">e li p ap kanpe lè vwa twonpèt la sone.<verse eid="JOB 39:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 39:25" />Depi twonpèt la sone li di: ‘Aha!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:25">Soti lwen, li pran sant batay la, tonnè a kapitèn yo ak kri gè a.<verse eid="JOB 39:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 39:26" />Èske se pa bon konprann ou ke malfini an</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:26">konn vole anlè, avèk zèl li lonje vè sid?<verse eid="JOB 39:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 39:27" />Èske se pa kòmand pa ou ke èg la monte wo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:27">pou fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:16">Jr 49:16</ref></char></note>nich li nan wotè?<verse eid="JOB 39:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 39:28" />Anwo sou falèz la, li rete e fè abitasyon li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:28">sou kwen wòch yon kote ki pa kab pwoche.<verse eid="JOB 39:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 39:29" />Se la li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:26">Job 9:26</ref></char></note>veye manje li;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:29">zye li wè l soti lwen.<verse eid="JOB 39:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 39:30" />Pitit li yo, anplis, konn souse san;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:30">epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:28">Mat 24:28</ref></char></note>kote mò yo ye; se la li ye.”<verse eid="JOB 39:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JOB 40" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 40:1" />Anplis, SENYÈ a te di a Job:<verse eid="JOB 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 40:2" />“Èske li k ap jwenn fot va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:9">És 45:9</ref></char></note>fè kont ak Tou Pwisan an?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:2">Kite li ki repwòche Bondye reponn sa.”<verse eid="JOB 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 40:3" />Konsa, Job te reponn SENYÈ a. Li te di:<verse eid="JOB 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 40:4" />“Anverite, mwen pa anyen; ki repons mwen kab bay Ou?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:4">Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 21:5">Job 21:5</ref></char></note>poze men m sou bouch mwen.<verse eid="JOB 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 40:5" />Yon fwa mwen te pale e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:3-15">Job 9:3-15</ref></char></note>mwen pa p replike l;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:5">menm de fwa, men m pap wale pi lwen.”<verse eid="JOB 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 40:6" />Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 38:1">Job 38:1</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a te reponn nan mitan toubiyon an. Li te di:<verse eid="JOB 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 40:7" />Alò, mare senti ou kon gason;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:7">Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 38:3">Job 38:3</ref></char></note>mande ou yon bagay, e ou va enstwi M.<verse eid="JOB 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 40:8" />Èske anverite ou va anile jijman Mwen an?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:8">Èske ou va kondane Mwen pou ou menm kab jistifye?<verse eid="JOB 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 40:9" />Oswa èske ou gen yon bra tankou Bondye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:9">ak yon vwa ki ka <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 37:5">Job 37:5</ref></char></note>gwonde tankou pa L la?<verse eid="JOB 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 40:10" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 93:1">Sòm 93:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Abiye ou menm ak mayifisans ak grandè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:10">Mete sou ou lonè ak laglwa.<verse eid="JOB 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 40:11" />Vide fè parèt nèt tout lakòlè k ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:25">És 42:25</ref></char></note>debòde nan ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:11">Fè yon ti gade sou tout sila ki gen ògèy yo, e desann yo.<verse eid="JOB 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 40:12" />Fè rega sou tout sila ki gen ògèy yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:7">I Sam 2:7</ref></char></note>fè yo bese, vin ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:12">Foule mechan yo nèt kote yo kanpe.<verse eid="JOB 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 40:13" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 2:10-12">És 2:10-12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kache yo ansanm nan pousyè a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:13">Mare figi yo nan plas kache a.<verse eid="JOB 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 40:14" />Epi konsa M ap konfese a ou menm</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:14">ke se pwòp men dwat ou ki kab sove ou.<verse eid="JOB 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 40:15" />Gade byen Beyemòt la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 40:19">Job 40:19</ref></char></note>ke M te fè</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:15">menm tankou Mwen te fè w la;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:15">Li manje zèb tankou bèf.<verse eid="JOB 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 40:16" />Gade koulye a, fòs li nan ren li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:16">e pouvwa li nan gwo venn a vant li yo.<verse eid="JOB 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 40:17" />Li koube ke li tankou yon sèd;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:17">venn nan kwis li yo koude ansanm nèt.<verse eid="JOB 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 40:18" />Zo li se tiyo ki fèt an bwonz;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:18">janm li tankou ba fè.<verse eid="JOB 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 40:19" />Li se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 41:33">Job 41:33</ref></char></note>premye nan chemen Bondye a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:19">fòk se Sila ki fè l la, ki pou pwoche nepe li.<verse eid="JOB 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 40:20" />Anverite, mòn yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:14">Sòm 104:14</ref></char></note>mennen bay li manje</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:20">kote tout bèt sovaj latè yo jwe.<verse eid="JOB 40:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 40:21" />Anba zèb dlo, li kouche;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:21">nan kouvèti wozo a ak marekaj la.<verse eid="JOB 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 40:22" />Plant dlo yo kouvri li ak lonbraj;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:22">bwa sikrèn k ap koule dlo a antoure li.<verse eid="JOB 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 40:23" />Lè rivyè a vin anraje, li pa twouble;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:23">li gen konfyans malgre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:10">Jen 13:10</ref></char></note>Jourdain an rive jis nan bouch li.<verse eid="JOB 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 40:24" />Èske gen moun ki kab kaptire li lè l ap veye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:24">menm ak pwent anfè, èske yon moun kab pèse nen l?<verse eid="JOB 40:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JOB 41" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 41:1" />Èske ou ka rale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 74:14">Sòm 74:14</ref></char></note>Levyatan an deyò ak yon zen lapèch?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:1">Oswa peze lang li desann ak yon kòd?<verse eid="JOB 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 41:2" />Èske ou kab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 19:28">II Wa 19:28</ref></char></note>mete yon kòd nan nen l,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:2">oswa pèse machwè l ak yon zen?<verse eid="JOB 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 41:3" />Èske l ap fè ou anpil siplikasyon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:3">oswa èske l ap pale ak ou ak pawòl dous?<verse eid="JOB 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 41:4" />Èske l ap fè yon akò avèk ou?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:4">Èske ou va pran l pou yon sèvitè pou tout tan?<verse eid="JOB 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 41:5" />Èske ou va jwe avè l konsi se yon zwazo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:5">oswa èske ou va mare li pou demwazèl ou yo?<verse eid="JOB 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 41:6" />Èske komèsan yo va fè komès avè l?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:6">Èske y ap divize li pami machann yo?<verse eid="JOB 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 41:7" />Èske ou kab plen po li ak gwo lans,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:7">oswa tèt li ak fren lapèch?<verse eid="JOB 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 41:8" />Poze men ou sou li! Sonje batay la byen!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:8">Ou p ap fè l ankò<verse eid="JOB 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 41:9" />Gade byen, esperans ou fo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:9">Èske ou p ap vin bese ou, menm devan rega li?<verse eid="JOB 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 41:10" />Nanpwen moun ki gen kouraj ase pou l ta tante <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:8">Job 3:8</ref></char></note>fè l leve.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:10">Ebyen, se kilès li ye ki kab kanpe devan M?<verse eid="JOB 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 41:11" />Kilès ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:35">Wo 11:35</ref></char></note>ban Mwen yon bagay pou M ta rekonpanse li?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:11">Tout bagay anba tout syèl la se pa M.<verse eid="JOB 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 41:12" />Konsa, Mwen p ap rete an silans akoz manm li yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:12">oswa gran pwisans li, oswa jan kò l byen òganize.<verse eid="JOB 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 41:13" />Se kilès ki kab retire pwotèj eksteyè li?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:13">Kilès ki kab penetre pwotèj fèt ak chenn doub?<verse eid="JOB 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 41:14" />Kilès ki kab ouvri pòt figi li?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:14">Gwo laperèz antoure dan l.<verse eid="JOB 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 41:15" />Gwo kal li yo se gran ògèy li;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:15">yo fèmen byen byen di.<verse eid="JOB 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 41:16" />Youn tèlman pre lòt ke menm lè pa kab pase antre yo.<verse eid="JOB 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 41:17" />Yo jwenn youn ak lòt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:17">yo kole yo chak youn sou lòt e yo pa kab separe.<verse eid="JOB 41:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 41:18" />Lè li estène, li fè limyè vin parèt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:18">e zye li tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:9">Job 3:9</ref></char></note>pòpyè zye nan maten.<verse eid="JOB 41:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 41:19" />Tòch dife yo sòti nan bouch li;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:19">sann volan yo vòltije vin parèt.<verse eid="JOB 41:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 41:20" />Sòti nan nen l, se lafimen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:20">konsi k ap sòti nan yon gwo bonm k ap bouyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:20">oswa fèy sèch k ap pran dife.<verse eid="JOB 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 41:21" />Souf li ka limen chabon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:21">e flanm yo sòti nan bouch li.<verse eid="JOB 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 41:22" />Kou li se yon rezèvwa fòs</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:22">e gwo laperèz danse devan l.<verse eid="JOB 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 41:23" />Tout pli sou chè li vin jwenn ansanm;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:23">byen solid sou li, e yo pa kab deplase.<verse eid="JOB 41:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 41:24" />Kè li di tankou wòch,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:24">di menm tankou gwo wòch moulen.<verse eid="JOB 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 41:25" />Lè l leve pi pwisan yo vin pè;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:25">akoz gwo son kraze brize a, yo fè bak nèt.<verse eid="JOB 41:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 41:26" />Nepe ki rive kote li pa kab fè anyen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:26">ni gwo lans lan, flèch la, ni frenn nan.<verse eid="JOB 41:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 41:27" />Pou li moso fè se konsi se pay;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:27">bwonz se tankou bwa pouri.<verse eid="JOB 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 41:28" />Flèch pa kab fè l sove ale;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:28">wòch fistibal se kras raje devan l.<verse eid="JOB 41:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 41:29" />Baton yo menm se pay.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:29">Li ri lè frenn nan kouri vin jwenn l.<verse eid="JOB 41:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 41:30" />Pati anba li se tankou cha kanari;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:30">li gaye tankou yon baton ki vannen sou labou.<verse eid="JOB 41:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 41:31" />Li fè pwofondè li yo bouyi tankou yon bonm;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:31">li fè lanmè a vin tankou yon ja pomad.<verse eid="JOB 41:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 41:32" />Dèyè l, li fè yon pa kim dlo briye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:32">konsi ou ta konnen se cheve blanch k ap soti nan fon dlo a.<verse eid="JOB 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 41:33" />Nanpwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 40:19">Job 40:19</ref></char></note>anyen sou latè ki tankou li;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:33">yon bèt ki fèt san pè anyen.<verse eid="JOB 41:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 41:34" />Li gade sou tout bagay ki wo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:34">Li se wa sou tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 28:8">Job 28:8</ref></char></note>fis ògèy yo.<verse eid="JOB 41:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JOB 42" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 42:1" />Job te reponn SENYÈ a. Li te di:<verse eid="JOB 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 42:2" />“Mwen konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Jen 18:14</ref></char></note>Ou ka fè tout bagay,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 42:2">e ke nanpwen volonte Ou ki kab detounen.<verse eid="JOB 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 42:3" />Ou te mande: ‘Kilès sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 38:2">Job 38:2</ref></char></note>kache konsèy san konesans lan?’”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 42:3">“Konsa, mwen te deklare sa ke m pa t konprann nan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 42:3">bagay twò etonnan pou mwen, ke m pa t konnen yo.<verse eid="JOB 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 42:4" />Ou te di: ‘Koute Mwen, e Mwen va pale;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 42:4">Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 38:3">Job 38:3</ref></char></note>mande Ou, e Ou va enstwi Mwen.’<verse eid="JOB 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 42:5" />“ Konsa, Mwen te kon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:17">Wo 10:17</ref></char></note>tande de Ou nan zòrèy mwen yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 42:5">men koulye a, zye m wè Ou.<verse eid="JOB 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 42:6" />Pou tout sa a, mwen rayi pwop tèt mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 42:6">e mwen repanti nan pousyè ak sann yo.”<verse eid="JOB 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 42:7" />Li te vin rive apre SENYÈ a te pale pawòl sa yo a Job, ke SENYÈ a te di a Éliphaz, Temanit lan: “Lakòlè mwen limen kont ou e kont de zanmi ou yo, akoz ou pa t pale selon Mwen sa ki dwat, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 40:3-5">Job 40:3-5</ref></char></note>tankou sèvitè Mwen Job te fè a. <verse eid="JOB 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 42:8" />Alò, pou sa, pran pou nou menm sèt towo avèk sèt belye, rive kote sèvitè Mwen an Job, e ofri yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:5">Job 1:5</ref></char></note>ofrann brile pou nou menm; epi sèvitè Mwen an, Job, va priye pou nou. Paske Mwen va aksepte li jis pou m pa aji avèk nou selon foli nou, akoz nou pa t pale selon Mwen sa ki bon, tankou sèvitè Mwen Job te fè a.”<verse eid="JOB 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 42:9" />Konsa, Éliphaz, Temanit lan avèk Bildad, Shouachyen an ak Tsophar, Naamatit la te ale fè sa ke SENYÈ a te di yo; epi SENYÈ a te aksepte Job.<verse eid="JOB 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 42:10" />SENYÈ a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 85:1-3">Sòm 85:1-3</ref></char></note>restore Job ak tout byen li ak pozisyon li lè l te priye pou zanmi li yo, e SENYÈ a te remèt tout sa li te genyen miltipliye de fwa anplis. <verse eid="JOB 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 42:11" />Konsa, tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 19:13">Job 19:13</ref></char></note>frè li yo ak sè li yo ak tout moun ki te konnen l oparavan yo te vin kote li, e yo te manje pen avèk li lakay li. Yo te rekonfòte li e konsole li akoz tout twoub ke SENYÈ a te mennen sou li yo. Epi yo chak te bay li yon pyès lajan ak yon bag an lò.<verse eid="JOB 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 42:12" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 1:10">Job 1:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>SENYÈ a te beni dènye jou a Job yo plis pase premye yo. Epi li te gen katòz-mil mouton ak si-mil chamo, ak mil bèf kabwèt ak mil femèl bourik. <verse eid="JOB 42:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 42:13" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:2">Job 1:2</ref></char></note>Li te gen sèt fis ak twa fi. <verse eid="JOB 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 42:14" />Li te rele premye a Jemima, dezyèm nan Ketsia, twazyèm nan Kéren-Happuc. <verse eid="JOB 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 42:15" />Nan tout peyi a, pa t gen fanm ki te bèl tankou fi a Job yo. Konsa, papa yo te bay yo yon eritaj pami frè yo. <verse eid="JOB 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 42:16" />Apre sa, Job te viv pandan san-karant lane, e te wè fis li yo ak pitit a fis li yo, jis rive nan kat jenerasyon. <verse eid="JOB 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 42:17" />Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:15">Jen 15:15</ref></char></note>Job te mouri, granmoun e plen ak jou.<verse eid="JOB 42:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 42" />
</usx>